(481358, 46644, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors, lighting is great too.  I could easily see this as an actual book cover.  The food all looks appetizing and is arranged very well.  I do wish there was a little more sharpness throughout the photo - the way the scene is composed all of the food items seem important to the image so I think it would be better if they were all in sharp focus.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Excellent colors, lighting is great too.  I could easily see this as an actual book cover.  The food all looks appetizing and is arranged very well.  I do wish there was a little more sharpness throughout the photo - the way the scene is composed all of the food items seem important to the image so I think it would be better if they were all in sharp focus.  Well done.  7', '2003-11-12 00:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(481364, 46652, 13390, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! What an absolutely gorgeous photo. Absolutely staggering! Very well done. If this doesn''t ribbon I will be EXTREMELY surprised. Simply marvelous. One of my most favorites on this site! Good luck! 10</td>', 'WOW!!! What an absolutely gorgeous photo. Absolutely staggering! Very well done. If this doesn''t ribbon I will be EXTREMELY surprised. Simply marvelous. One of my most favorites on this site! Good luck! 10', '2003-11-12 00:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(481365, 46601, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, fun image.  Very simple with nice rich colors and the focus looks good as well.  I wish the whole orange on the right was visible, or at least the whole face of it.  Lighting is good as well, not sure if a different background would add a bit more interest to the image or not.  Nicely done.  6</td>', 'Heh, fun image.  Very simple with nice rich colors and the focus looks good as well.  I wish the whole orange on the right was visible, or at least the whole face of it.  Lighting is good as well, not sure if a different background would add a bit more interest to the image or not.  Nicely done.  6', '2003-11-12 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(481366, 46410, 13336, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked this better on a completely black backround, with no discernable surface.  cool concept.  i like that you kept the knife in the image to suggest the hint of violence.</td>', 'i think i would have liked this better on a completely black backround, with no discernable surface.  cool concept.  i like that you kept the knife in the image to suggest the hint of violence.', '2003-11-12 00:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
