(481371, 46162, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the book.  A ten from me!</td>', 'Great interpretation of the book.  A ten from me!', '2003-11-12 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(481375, 46651, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice silhouette type image.  With the title, I think the focus should be on the parachute, and thus cropping a fair amount of the bottom is a suggestion, so that the trees aren''t taking precedence.  The colors look a little washed out, probably due to the fading light?  Wish they could''ve been a bit more vivid.  An overall sharpness to the image would help tighten up the photo too IMO.  4</td>', 'This is a nice silhouette type image.  With the title, I think the focus should be on the parachute, and thus cropping a fair amount of the bottom is a suggestion, so that the trees aren''t taking precedence.  The colors look a little washed out, probably due to the fading light?  Wish they could''ve been a bit more vivid.  An overall sharpness to the image would help tighten up the photo too IMO.  4', '2003-11-12 01:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(481376, 46354, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  You''ve captured some magnificent color and I like the way the contrast so brightly.  The droplets are well defined and the focus is excellent.  Good composition and the lighting is just right.  Very nicely done.  7</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  You''ve captured some magnificent color and I like the way the contrast so brightly.  The droplets are well defined and the focus is excellent.  Good composition and the lighting is just right.  Very nicely done.  7', '2003-11-12 01:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(481378, 46561, 11923, '<td valign="top">Aww what a sweetheart.  Gorgeous baby, well composed - I like the fact that the clasped hands are in the image, gives another focal point and adds interest.  I do wish the white wasn''t so stark, really distract for me, perhaps a softer light would have played up the white and created a better foil for the child''s skin.  Nice work.  6</td>', 'Aww what a sweetheart.  Gorgeous baby, well composed - I like the fact that the clasped hands are in the image, gives another focal point and adds interest.  I do wish the white wasn''t so stark, really distract for me, perhaps a softer light would have played up the white and created a better foil for the child''s skin.  Nice work.  6', '2003-11-12 01:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
