(481411, 46649, 12661, '<td valign="top">Deja vu. I laughed more when I saw the other submission like this one, but that doesn''t mean I didn''t laugh again.  Nice idea mixing the different grape types.</td>', 'Deja vu. I laughed more when I saw the other submission like this one, but that doesn''t mean I didn''t laugh again.  Nice idea mixing the different grape types.', '2003-11-12 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(481412, 46596, 13496, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  It should be used for the next edition of the book.  It gives me a nostalgic adventurous feeling.  I would however suggest that the colors be saturated a little more and try cropping the photo closer to the top of the hydrant. Just a couple of suggestions.  Good work.<br/>-Scocchio</td>', 'I love this photo.  It should be used for the next edition of the book.  It gives me a nostalgic adventurous feeling.  I would however suggest that the colors be saturated a little more and try cropping the photo closer to the top of the hydrant. Just a couple of suggestions.  Good work.-Scocchio', '2003-11-12 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(481413, 46004, 9073, '<td valign="top">Whereas I like the idea here, I''m not sure about the actual implementation. It''s a bit dull - flat objects placed flatly in a long, flat frame. If your theme is to present badness (I don''t mean that this shot is particuarly bad) in photography, it might have been more effective to have chosen an obviously bad example of photography and had the books as a lesser element. 4</td>', 'Whereas I like the idea here, I''m not sure about the actual implementation. It''s a bit dull - flat objects placed flatly in a long, flat frame. If your theme is to present badness (I don''t mean that this shot is particuarly bad) in photography, it might have been more effective to have chosen an obviously bad example of photography and had the books as a lesser element. 4', '2003-11-12 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(481414, 46104, 13749, '<td valign="top">would have been slightly more appealing if they were level with horizontal</td>', 'would have been slightly more appealing if they were level with horizontal', '2003-11-12 01:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
