(481418, 46548, 1031, '<td valign="top">His grip on the brush looks a little funny -- maybe if he''d been holding it up. Tom''s also frequently pictured in a tattered straw hat. Also, although the light looks strong, it looks a bit harsh -- logical since it''s likely Winter and not Summer lighting. A Sepia or Duotone treatment may have made this look a little sunnier ...<br/>Overall a good representation of a classic scene from the book.</td>', 'His grip on the brush looks a little funny -- maybe if he''d been holding it up. Tom''s also frequently pictured in a tattered straw hat. Also, although the light looks strong, it looks a bit harsh -- logical since it''s likely Winter and not Summer lighting. A Sepia or Duotone treatment may have made this look a little sunnier ...Overall a good representation of a classic scene from the book.', '2003-11-12 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(481419, 46596, 12661, '<td valign="top">The firehydrant definately makes this photograph. It reminds me of my younger days, there was a place in my neighborhood where a sidewalk ended much like this one does. I always thought of the book when I saw that sidewalk.</td>', 'The firehydrant definately makes this photograph. It reminds me of my younger days, there was a place in my neighborhood where a sidewalk ended much like this one does. I always thought of the book when I saw that sidewalk.', '2003-11-12 01:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
