(481586, 45822, 9146, '<td valign="top">a road "less" traveled would look unpaved and unused this road dose not.<br/> <br/>Also you have a keystoning problem and blowout in the sky. grayscale or sepia toning would probobly solve the blowout problem and with your composition give you a sronger image.<br/>as for the keystoning outside of a diffrent lens and a DPCilleagle photoshop fix I don''t know what to do. sorry<br/> <br/>After the challenge I''d be intrested to see if you sent this to the fourm what beter minds come up with<br/> <br/>Blessings <br/>jo</td>', 'a road "less" traveled would look unpaved and unused this road dose not. Also you have a keystoning problem and blowout in the sky. grayscale or sepia toning would probobly solve the blowout problem and with your composition give you a sronger image.as for the keystoning outside of a diffrent lens and a DPCilleagle photoshop fix I don''t know what to do. sorry After the challenge I''d be intrested to see if you sent this to the fourm what beter minds come up with Blessings jo', '2003-11-12 03:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
