(481942, 46050, 5728, '<td valign="top">The way she is pressing her arms inwards justifies the tight crop. As if she is squeezing herself into the frame, I like that concept, certainly something different. The idea of the projected lighting is very good, I especially like the way one eye is highlighted within the circle with the curved hair below it leading into the eye. I am impressed!</td>', 'The way she is pressing her arms inwards justifies the tight crop. As if she is squeezing herself into the frame, I like that concept, certainly something different. The idea of the projected lighting is very good, I especially like the way one eye is highlighted within the circle with the curved hair below it leading into the eye. I am impressed!', '2003-11-12 09:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(481944, 46654, 13957, '<td valign="top">The moon is a reall pain in the tail to get right.  This one is WAY over exposed.  You need to take this down at least 2 stops.</td>', 'The moon is a reall pain in the tail to get right.  This one is WAY over exposed.  You need to take this down at least 2 stops.', '2003-11-12 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
