(481951, 46131, 13957, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Very creative.  The lighting is right on.  Excelent.<br/> <br/>And a good book too.</td>', 'Great capture.  Very creative.  The lighting is right on.  Excelent. And a good book too.', '2003-11-12 09:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(481952, 46320, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive photo. The detail on the bird is very prominent, brought out even more throught the shallow DOF. I know you couldn''t have done anything about it, but the color of the eye clashes against the blue background.</td>', 'Impressive photo. The detail on the bird is very prominent, brought out even more throught the shallow DOF. I know you couldn''t have done anything about it, but the color of the eye clashes against the blue background.', '2003-11-12 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
