(481955, 46277, 10634, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the cat was IN the hat. I know how unwilling cats are to be models, though ... tried to use mine for a couple shots for this challenge myself and they just would not help me out. :-)</td>', 'Would have been better if the cat was IN the hat. I know how unwilling cats are to be models, though ... tried to use mine for a couple shots for this challenge myself and they just would not help me out. :-)', '2003-11-12 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
