(481964, 46644, 675, '<td valign="top">why use the ugly table covering? why not buy some white paper? would have made for an amazing still life.  as it is i like it, but the tablecloth is pretty bad</td>', 'why use the ugly table covering? why not buy some white paper? would have made for an amazing still life.  as it is i like it, but the tablecloth is pretty bad', '2003-11-12 09:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(481968, 46416, 13759, '<td valign="top">Nothing is sharpen here. It´s confuse and unclear. May be cause I´m not know the book! But the same way you need to put somothing in focus, not? Ok, if you try to do a mosaic or a full blured image, fails to, cause of it´s very soft.</td>', 'Nothing is sharpen here. It´s confuse and unclear. May be cause I´m not know the book! But the same way you need to put somothing in focus, not? Ok, if you try to do a mosaic or a full blured image, fails to, cause of it´s very soft.', '2003-11-12 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
