(482029, 46447, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp. Good idea using the net in the background half buried in sand, it gives it that old piratey feeling to it. The cork looks too new and doesn''t give me the feel that the bottle has been floating around for a long time. I would have aged it or battered it around a bit (9)</td>', 'Very clear and sharp. Good idea using the net in the background half buried in sand, it gives it that old piratey feeling to it. The cork looks too new and doesn''t give me the feel that the bottle has been floating around for a long time. I would have aged it or battered it around a bit (9)', '2003-11-12 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
