(482550, 46197, 12327, '<td valign="top">I wish the lighting was a little softer</td>', 'I wish the lighting was a little softer', '2003-11-12 14:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482551, 45666, 327, '<td valign="top">Photo-journalistic. Very moving shot. Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'Photo-journalistic. Very moving shot. Good luck in the challenge', '2003-11-12 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(482552, 46670, 12327, '<td valign="top">nice, but I''d crop a bit different so the sword wouldn''t be totally centered.</td>', 'nice, but I''d crop a bit different so the sword wouldn''t be totally centered.', '2003-11-12 14:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482553, 46607, 12268, '<td valign="top">great macro shot &amp; I love that it is in b/w, which I think gives it a certain extra something to the title. Meets the challenge very well. Even more, the blurred BG adds something more as well. I think it is a perfect shot. Gonna give it a 10!</td>', 'great macro shot & I love that it is in b/w, which I think gives it a certain extra something to the title. Meets the challenge very well. Even more, the blurred BG adds something more as well. I think it is a perfect shot. Gonna give it a 10!', '2003-11-12 14:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(482557, 46541, 327, '<td valign="top">One of my top three favorite books, movie. I thought of this for a shot but of course didn''t know if I could find a dove. You did and did it well. I like the tones and the composition.</td>', 'One of my top three favorite books, movie. I thought of this for a shot but of course didn''t know if I could find a dove. You did and did it well. I like the tones and the composition.', '2003-11-12 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(482559, 46652, 327, '<td valign="top">Very good, deep rich colors. Nice. Congrats.</td>', 'Very good, deep rich colors. Nice. Congrats.', '2003-11-12 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482560, 45678, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is such a wonderful shot! I love the angle, the contrasting colours, everything. Where was this taken? I wan to say it is the Golen Gate Bridge but that''s red.</td>', 'this is such a wonderful shot! I love the angle, the contrasting colours, everything. Where was this taken? I wan to say it is the Golen Gate Bridge but that''s red.', '2003-11-12 14:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(482561, 46676, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL....look at the joy on his face...what a hoot he''s having!! Kids dream. Good focus and fun shot.</td>', 'LOL....look at the joy on his face...what a hoot he''s having!! Kids dream. Good focus and fun shot.', '2003-11-12 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(482563, 46664, 12268, '<td valign="top">fantastic, unique, macro shot. It seems you took the shot at the perfect time.</td>', 'fantastic, unique, macro shot. It seems you took the shot at the perfect time.', '2003-11-12 14:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(482566, 46644, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and color. I think the shot would of benefited with a different colored  table cloth....?that or if you''d moved in tighter. Still I admire this shot, it''s very good. Artistic set up. Good luck in the challenge, you''ll do well.</td>', 'Wonderful light and color. I think the shot would of benefited with a different colored  table cloth....?that or if you''d moved in tighter. Still I admire this shot, it''s very good. Artistic set up. Good luck in the challenge, you''ll do well.', '2003-11-12 14:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(482573, 46515, 327, '<td valign="top">whoooohoo! I love this one. Stunning shot, focus, light. Wow #1.</td>', 'whoooohoo! I love this one. Stunning shot, focus, light. Wow #1.', '2003-11-12 14:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(482578, 46652, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent :)</td>', 'excellent :)', '2003-11-12 14:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(482579, 45869, 10848, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, very creative, need to know how you did this I like it</td>', 'amazing shot, very creative, need to know how you did this I like it', '2003-11-12 14:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(482580, 46174, 327, '<td valign="top">My gosh....stunning shot. Big wow from me!!</td>', 'My gosh....stunning shot. Big wow from me!!', '2003-11-12 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482583, 46267, 10848, '<td valign="top">Love the expression of the cat, looks like he enjoying sharpening his claws on the hat lol, I love it, nice to see something relaxing and enjoying life.</td>', 'Love the expression of the cat, looks like he enjoying sharpening his claws on the hat lol, I love it, nice to see something relaxing and enjoying life.', '2003-11-12 14:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(482586, 46674, 12583, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/>I don''t know how you found a red fern amongst green ones, but the shot is beautiful. I also loved the book, not that that matters any! :)</td>', 'Beautiful!I don''t know how you found a red fern amongst green ones, but the shot is beautiful. I also loved the book, not that that matters any! :)', '2003-11-12 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(482587, 45667, 12583, '<td valign="top">Too good to be bothered?<br/>I like the way this shot was set up... and what beautiful clarity!</td>', 'Too good to be bothered?I like the way this shot was set up... and what beautiful clarity!', '2003-11-12 14:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(482588, 46681, 12583, '<td valign="top">Charlotte, you''re so much scarier in real life!<br/>A very neat shot, though I didn''t much like the orange-yellow color. Still, really good!</td>', 'Charlotte, you''re so much scarier in real life!A very neat shot, though I didn''t much like the orange-yellow color. Still, really good!', '2003-11-12 14:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(482593, 46429, 12583, '<td valign="top">A good concept, but a bit blurry. Had it been a bit sharper, it would have been a lot better IMO. The apple on black creates a very nice contrast though!</td>', 'A good concept, but a bit blurry. Had it been a bit sharper, it would have been a lot better IMO. The apple on black creates a very nice contrast though!', '2003-11-12 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(482594, 46438, 12583, '<td valign="top">I''ve always sat on planes wishing I had my camera... looks like you were more prepared than I was! Very nice.</td>', 'I''ve always sat on planes wishing I had my camera... looks like you were more prepared than I was! Very nice.', '2003-11-12 14:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(482598, 46628, 13025, '<td valign="top">Holy Smokes! <br/>That''s a tough one to capture! <br/>Good effort ;) M</td>', 'Holy Smokes! That''s a tough one to capture! Good effort ;) M', '2003-11-12 14:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482599, 46050, 13149, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about book title, but photo itself is just piece of art! Always surprised how ppl do such thing and I can''t, heh. Good luck to you with the ribbon.</td>', 'I don''t know about book title, but photo itself is just piece of art! Always surprised how ppl do such thing and I can''t, heh. Good luck to you with the ribbon.', '2003-11-12 14:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(482600, 45825, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea. :-) Anyway I would have chosen a more homogenic background (something like black, dark grey or really dark beige) and the letter "A" should be all scarlet red in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice Idea. :-) Anyway I would have chosen a more homogenic background (something like black, dark grey or really dark beige) and the letter "A" should be all scarlet red in my opinion.', '2003-11-12 14:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(482605, 46429, 10858, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject, I like it, and unique in this challenge! :-) Anyway I think the background could be more homogenic - all black, and maybe you could have ironed the canvas before photographing -, and this shot could be also sharper, especially the hand, and lighting could be less harsch on the hand, too.</td>', 'Lovely subject, I like it, and unique in this challenge! :-) Anyway I think the background could be more homogenic - all black, and maybe you could have ironed the canvas before photographing -, and this shot could be also sharper, especially the hand, and lighting could be less harsch on the hand, too.', '2003-11-12 14:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(482606, 46174, 13149, '<td valign="top">Oh, so sweet princess, this is great photo, lighting very good. If its your daughter you are lucky one!</td>', 'Oh, so sweet princess, this is great photo, lighting very good. If its your daughter you are lucky one!', '2003-11-12 14:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(482607, 46172, 3569, '<td valign="top">And what does the face in the fire mean?  Nice shot.</td>', 'And what does the face in the fire mean?  Nice shot.', '2003-11-12 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(482623, 46162, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great shot...love the black and white with the red and green accents...well done!</td>', 'Great shot...love the black and white with the red and green accents...well done!', '2003-11-12 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(482624, 46630, 6668, '<td valign="top">photo seems a  bit dark.</td>', 'photo seems a  bit dark.', '2003-11-12 15:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(482626, 46631, 12583, '<td valign="top">Good, but it might have been more striking had you had the coffee black and added in the millk just before taking the shot... a white mixing in dark type of thing?</td>', 'Good, but it might have been more striking had you had the coffee black and added in the millk just before taking the shot... a white mixing in dark type of thing?', '2003-11-12 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(482628, 46416, 6668, '<td valign="top">photo is way to blurry almost hurts the eyes to look at it.</td>', 'photo is way to blurry almost hurts the eyes to look at it.', '2003-11-12 15:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(482629, 46601, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, well executed.  Might have been even cuter and more dramatic/professional looking to put the clock hands right on the orange!</td>', 'Cute idea, well executed.  Might have been even cuter and more dramatic/professional looking to put the clock hands right on the orange!', '2003-11-12 15:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(482630, 46493, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good decisive moment shot; some noise could have been removed by NeatImage.</td>', 'Good decisive moment shot; some noise could have been removed by NeatImage.', '2003-11-12 15:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(482631, 46649, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL...I had a similar idea suggested to me but didn''t have any grapes on hand...funny shot!</td>', 'LOL...I had a similar idea suggested to me but didn''t have any grapes on hand...funny shot!', '2003-11-12 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(482632, 46664, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great book, and excellent job.</td>', 'Great book, and excellent job.', '2003-11-12 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(482633, 46171, 10858, '<td valign="top">LOL, this one is humorous :-))) Nice idea, and this is a woman who says that. :-) Maybe the composition and the technical makeout is too simple for me, looks like you just shot your camera - lighting and composition can be improved, for example I would have made the shot from a different angle.</td>', 'LOL, this one is humorous :-))) Nice idea, and this is a woman who says that. :-) Maybe the composition and the technical makeout is too simple for me, looks like you just shot your camera - lighting and composition can be improved, for example I would have made the shot from a different angle.', '2003-11-12 15:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(482637, 46667, 12661, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph. I am mostly impressed that you car can go 65mph at only 2000 RPM.</td>', 'Very nice photograph. I am mostly impressed that you car can go 65mph at only 2000 RPM.', '2003-11-12 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(482638, 46610, 10145, '<td valign="top">I like this. BW suits it well</td>', 'I like this. BW suits it well', '2003-11-12 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(482641, 46681, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very dark, hard to see what is going on here. May have benefited from a different light source.</td>', 'Very dark, hard to see what is going on here. May have benefited from a different light source.', '2003-11-12 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
