(482660, 46417, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture in the water, although I wish there were more light on the bird, but understand that probably couldn''t be helped. 7</td>', 'Beautiful texture in the water, although I wish there were more light on the bird, but understand that probably couldn''t be helped. 7', '2003-11-12 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(482664, 46524, 6668, '<td valign="top">The light pole in the middle of the shot is distracting.</td>', 'The light pole in the middle of the shot is distracting.', '2003-11-12 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(482666, 46675, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too dark to appreciate the way I feel you intended.</td>', 'This is a bit too dark to appreciate the way I feel you intended.', '2003-11-12 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(482668, 46428, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very inventive eggs!! And a smiley face to boot.</td>', 'Very inventive eggs!! And a smiley face to boot.', '2003-11-12 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(482669, 46549, 12327, '<td valign="top">a little extra DOF would really help imho.</td>', 'a little extra DOF would really help imho.', '2003-11-12 15:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(482678, 46402, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, like the panaramic cropping also like the border.  Nicely done! I give it a 10!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, like the panaramic cropping also like the border.  Nicely done! I give it a 10!', '2003-11-12 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(482680, 46112, 10858, '<td valign="top">Technically nice job, I am just missing some life from the corridors. For example 2 models, one for Romeo, and one for Juliet, without them it seems a bit empty, something that is lack of the most importantsubject. Anyway, sepia colours work well here. :-)</td>', 'Technically nice job, I am just missing some life from the corridors. For example 2 models, one for Romeo, and one for Juliet, without them it seems a bit empty, something that is lack of the most importantsubject. Anyway, sepia colours work well here. :-)', '2003-11-12 15:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(482684, 46302, 6668, '<td valign="top">I don''t personally care for the thick blocky border with this one. I like the shot itself, and the black and white works well with it also, just maybe a smaller border or no border at all.</td>', 'I don''t personally care for the thick blocky border with this one. I like the shot itself, and the black and white works well with it also, just maybe a smaller border or no border at all.', '2003-11-12 15:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(482685, 46171, 6668, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but unfortunately doesn''t make for a very appealing photo.</td>', 'Creative idea, but unfortunately doesn''t make for a very appealing photo.', '2003-11-12 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(482699, 46167, 13136, '<td valign="top">Well lit and composed. Good interpretation of the title as well.</td>', 'Well lit and composed. Good interpretation of the title as well.', '2003-11-12 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(482700, 46418, 6668, '<td valign="top">wow, I bet you are getting alot of comments on this one! LoL, Although slightly disturbing it is somehow cute in a strange morbid way if that makes sense lol, although I''m not sure how it would do on the cover of a children''s book, but you get extra points for having a sense of humor! 8</td>', 'wow, I bet you are getting alot of comments on this one! LoL, Although slightly disturbing it is somehow cute in a strange morbid way if that makes sense lol, although I''m not sure how it would do on the cover of a children''s book, but you get extra points for having a sense of humor! 8', '2003-11-12 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(482703, 46429, 13136, '<td valign="top">Too fuzzy.</td>', 'Too fuzzy.', '2003-11-12 15:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(482713, 46538, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture. I''m not sharp enough to see the connection between the picture and the title.</td>', 'Very pretty picture. I''m not sharp enough to see the connection between the picture and the title.', '2003-11-12 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(482722, 46131, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props and unusual composition. Background white paper could do with it''s own lighting to render it more purely white.</td>', 'Nice use of props and unusual composition. Background white paper could do with it''s own lighting to render it more purely white.', '2003-11-12 15:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(482723, 45943, 13136, '<td valign="top">Apt picture/title relationship. Cool picture.</td>', 'Apt picture/title relationship. Cool picture.', '2003-11-12 15:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(482725, 46198, 3087, '<td valign="top">Striking abstract with some interesting texture details.</td>', 'Striking abstract with some interesting texture details.', '2003-11-12 15:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(482726, 46423, 3087, '<td valign="top">There''s just not much of interest here. There''s no doubt something highly relevant to killing a mockingbird in that hole within the tree but, at this wide angle, it''s impossible to see what it is. Instead the result is a particularly dull image of a tree trunk. Trunk bark is a lovely texture though and exposure seems even.</td>', 'There''s just not much of interest here. There''s no doubt something highly relevant to killing a mockingbird in that hole within the tree but, at this wide angle, it''s impossible to see what it is. Instead the result is a particularly dull image of a tree trunk. Trunk bark is a lovely texture though and exposure seems even.', '2003-11-12 15:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(482727, 46451, 13136, '<td valign="top">Title spelled correctly? Nice imagery with the angel.</td>', 'Title spelled correctly? Nice imagery with the angel.', '2003-11-12 15:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(482728, 46596, 3087, '<td valign="top">Does match the title but the result is an unfortunately dull image. Static central composition, absolutely nothing of interest to look at and lifeless colours. Idea is good but realisation hasn''t come through.</td>', 'Does match the title but the result is an unfortunately dull image. Static central composition, absolutely nothing of interest to look at and lifeless colours. Idea is good but realisation hasn''t come through.', '2003-11-12 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(482729, 46396, 10858, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the moment! I love the effect that the sinking ice-cube makes in the water, and also outside the water, the shapes of drops are fantastic. :-) B&amp;W fits this photo very much, too, so one of my very few 10 points during this challenge! Congrats!</td>', 'Excellent capture of the moment! I love the effect that the sinking ice-cube makes in the water, and also outside the water, the shapes of drops are fantastic. :-) B&W fits this photo very much, too, so one of my very few 10 points during this challenge! Congrats!', '2003-11-12 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(482731, 46004, 10643, '<td valign="top">this is a picture of the book and another competing book, not a picture of the title as the challenge asked for.</td>', 'this is a picture of the book and another competing book, not a picture of the title as the challenge asked for.', '2003-11-12 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482732, 46447, 10643, '<td valign="top">a lovely, careful setup</td>', 'a lovely, careful setup', '2003-11-12 15:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(482733, 46548, 10643, '<td valign="top">this is a picture of the content of the story, not a picture of the title as the challenge asked for. otherwise very good.</td>', 'this is a picture of the content of the story, not a picture of the title as the challenge asked for. otherwise very good.', '2003-11-12 15:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(482735, 46460, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The lighting is superb, and the photo is very interesting.  I always give 10s to half naked beautiful women, but this one is a true 10.  Good work.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wow!  The lighting is superb, and the photo is very interesting.  I always give 10s to half naked beautiful women, but this one is a true 10.  Good work.  Jacko.  10', '2003-11-12 15:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482736, 46267, 10643, '<td valign="top">the book title is "in" not "n" or "and." had the cat actually been sitting inside the hat, this would have been clever and attractive AND met the challenge. as it is, it''s not, and it doesn''t.</td>', 'the book title is "in" not "n" or "and." had the cat actually been sitting inside the hat, this would have been clever and attractive AND met the challenge. as it is, it''s not, and it doesn''t.', '2003-11-12 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(482738, 46226, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I shot Indian Corn for the last challenge. I love looking at it in all the many colors it comes in. Beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice. I shot Indian Corn for the last challenge. I love looking at it in all the many colors it comes in. Beautiful.', '2003-11-12 15:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(482741, 45831, 3087, '<td valign="top">There may well be enormous relevance in terms of subject matter, however since I don''t know the book I''ll refrain from commenting on that aspect.<br/>As an image this doesn''t work at all for me. Horizon is tilted, composition is messy - lighting is poor with an unpleasant glare at the right. Image quality is also very poor.</td>', 'There may well be enormous relevance in terms of subject matter, however since I don''t know the book I''ll refrain from commenting on that aspect.As an image this doesn''t work at all for me. Horizon is tilted, composition is messy - lighting is poor with an unpleasant glare at the right. Image quality is also very poor.', '2003-11-12 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(482743, 46616, 10643, '<td valign="top">this is more a picture of the content of the story than a picture of the title. very attractive though. the torn/broken fingernail is distracting.</td>', 'this is more a picture of the content of the story than a picture of the title. very attractive though. the torn/broken fingernail is distracting.', '2003-11-12 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(482744, 46600, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition here. I would of like the shot a bit lower or maybe more from the front. Still I like this. Kool lighting and excellent moody shot.</td>', 'Very nice composition here. I would of like the shot a bit lower or maybe more from the front. Still I like this. Kool lighting and excellent moody shot.', '2003-11-12 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482746, 46357, 10643, '<td valign="top">is this a book title? or a typo?</td>', 'is this a book title? or a typo?', '2003-11-12 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(482749, 46575, 327, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic bridge that is. Discovery had a good show on how it was built. Wonderful art. You''ve really caught the majesty of it.</td>', 'What a fantastic bridge that is. Discovery had a good show on how it was built. Wonderful art. You''ve really caught the majesty of it.', '2003-11-12 15:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(482751, 46002, 3087, '<td valign="top">A striking image with wonderful richness of colour and light. What a contrast of deep blue skyand golden leaves. Leading line of tree trunks and road into the distance is also pleasing - a good composition.</td>', 'A striking image with wonderful richness of colour and light. What a contrast of deep blue skyand golden leaves. Leading line of tree trunks and road into the distance is also pleasing - a good composition.', '2003-11-12 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(482752, 46668, 327, '<td valign="top">Really pretty vase/dish? I love it. Sure fits the title well. Congrats on a good shot.</td>', 'Really pretty vase/dish? I love it. Sure fits the title well. Congrats on a good shot.', '2003-11-12 15:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
