(482937, 46198, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow abstract, I hate abstract photos like this! That''s what I thought when I saw the thumbnail anyway. But now I have it in full I find there is something about it that is appealing. The reds and blacks are communicating with each other. The curves spiralling into the middle bring in a kind of harmony which really makes this abstract a pleasure to look at.</td>', 'Wow abstract, I hate abstract photos like this! That''s what I thought when I saw the thumbnail anyway. But now I have it in full I find there is something about it that is appealing. The reds and blacks are communicating with each other. The curves spiralling into the middle bring in a kind of harmony which really makes this abstract a pleasure to look at.', '2003-11-12 17:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
