(483479, 46460, 3295, '<td valign="top">Shes cute... Lighting could have added more to the mood you were going for though... Maybe front light with the gun moving into shaddows and the red glow of the smoke showing.  I like the angle.</td>', 'Shes cute... Lighting could have added more to the mood you were going for though... Maybe front light with the gun moving into shaddows and the red glow of the smoke showing.  I like the angle.', '2003-11-12 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(483480, 46648, 3295, '<td valign="top">yep... On camera flash is known for its harsh, unflattering light that causes red eye.  Funny though.</td>', 'yep... On camera flash is known for its harsh, unflattering light that causes red eye.  Funny though.', '2003-11-12 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
