(483652, 46652, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The colours work well, nice composition.</td>', 'Love this.  The colours work well, nice composition.', '2003-11-13 03:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(483655, 46204, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sensational.  The colour/light is tremendous.</td>', 'Sensational.  The colour/light is tremendous.', '2003-11-13 04:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(483657, 46664, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the burning paper and the capture of the flaming egde. I''m much less keen on your choice for a background - the white is too bright and, although I can appreciate the decision to go for a blurred effect, the blurred text is too uneven in layout to really contribute to a strong composition.</td>', 'I like the curve of the burning paper and the capture of the flaming egde. I''m much less keen on your choice for a background - the white is too bright and, although I can appreciate the decision to go for a blurred effect, the blurred text is too uneven in layout to really contribute to a strong composition.', '2003-11-13 04:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(483659, 46173, 8643, '<td valign="top">It took a while to realise this was a triple exposure.  Maybe less time omn each exposure would have added to the ghostly feeling?  Nice idea.</td>', 'It took a while to realise this was a triple exposure.  Maybe less time omn each exposure would have added to the ghostly feeling?  Nice idea.', '2003-11-13 04:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483660, 45905, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image full of vivid emotions and excitement. Good choice to go black and white.</td>', 'A beautiful image full of vivid emotions and excitement. Good choice to go black and white.', '2003-11-13 04:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(483661, 46615, 8643, '<td valign="top">Clever title association - nice photo.</td>', 'Clever title association - nice photo.', '2003-11-13 04:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(483662, 46668, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well composed and good choice of angle. Background a little unevenly lit. Colour balance seems a little yellow, was that intentional?</td>', 'Well composed and good choice of angle. Background a little unevenly lit. Colour balance seems a little yellow, was that intentional?', '2003-11-13 04:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(483663, 46058, 8643, '<td valign="top">Big smile, clever idea.  Would have preferred a composition that did not create an out of focus grape.</td>', 'Big smile, clever idea.  Would have preferred a composition that did not create an out of focus grape.', '2003-11-13 04:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(483664, 46008, 3087, '<td valign="top">Would be much improved if not on a tilt - the lines of the floor are quite dominant and would hence be best kept on a true horizontal. Nice sense of depth/ perspective. Would have gone for black and white myself.</td>', 'Would be much improved if not on a tilt - the lines of the floor are quite dominant and would hence be best kept on a true horizontal. Nice sense of depth/ perspective. Would have gone for black and white myself.', '2003-11-13 04:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(483666, 46538, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the contents - great choice of subject with lots of wonderful weathered texture detail and some strong lines from the white paint. Interesting detail of the box - I assume that it relates to the book story? Only thing that doesn''t quite work for me is the angle from which we''re looking at the subject and the way that makes the vertical and horizontals so wonky within the frame.</td>', 'I like the contents - great choice of subject with lots of wonderful weathered texture detail and some strong lines from the white paint. Interesting detail of the box - I assume that it relates to the book story? Only thing that doesn''t quite work for me is the angle from which we''re looking at the subject and the way that makes the vertical and horizontals so wonky within the frame.', '2003-11-13 04:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(483667, 46395, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very impressive, I love the cark contrasts.</td>', 'Very impressive, I love the cark contrasts.', '2003-11-13 04:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(483668, 46660, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great idea, marred by the very dark shadow towards the top - could do with some additional lighting up there, and the curved (exterior?) overhang that''s blocking the reflection of sky and clouds towards the top of the mirror.</td>', 'A great idea, marred by the very dark shadow towards the top - could do with some additional lighting up there, and the curved (exterior?) overhang that''s blocking the reflection of sky and clouds towards the top of the mirror.', '2003-11-13 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(483669, 46676, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet! Lighting could be improved - perhaps some tissue or cloth over the lighting source to soften it and reduce the glare on the metal bowl? A touch more light onto his face would also be good.</td>', 'Sweet! Lighting could be improved - perhaps some tissue or cloth over the lighting source to soften it and reduce the glare on the metal bowl? A touch more light onto his face would also be good.', '2003-11-13 04:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(483670, 46679, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the expression on  the model is priceless.  Love it.  I used to have a friend who would dress this way before informing people she was "queen of the f**king universe". :)</td>', 'Great shot, the expression on  the model is priceless.  Love it.  I used to have a friend who would dress this way before informing people she was "queen of the f**king universe". :)', '2003-11-13 04:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(483671, 46565, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, especially the lighting.</td>', 'Very nicely done, especially the lighting.', '2003-11-13 04:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483672, 45769, 3087, '<td valign="top">A clever approach to this book title. I''d crop marginally at the bottom to remove that area of wrist at the lower left corner.</td>', 'A clever approach to this book title. I''d crop marginally at the bottom to remove that area of wrist at the lower left corner.', '2003-11-13 04:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(483673, 46167, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of subtle lighting and of shadows to create mood. I''d like to see the lit area just a touch more horizontally centred - ie crop from the right a fraction.</td>', 'Great use of subtle lighting and of shadows to create mood. I''d like to see the lit area just a touch more horizontally centred - ie crop from the right a fraction.', '2003-11-13 04:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(483674, 46172, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great idea, although too few will recognise the name.  Nice fire photo.</td>', 'Great idea, although too few will recognise the name.  Nice fire photo.', '2003-11-13 04:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(483675, 46657, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour and excellent composition.  The background is very effective.</td>', 'Great use of colour and excellent composition.  The background is very effective.', '2003-11-13 04:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(483676, 46664, 10170, '<td valign="top">The fire along the edge is very well done indeed.  Great shot.</td>', 'The fire along the edge is very well done indeed.  Great shot.', '2003-11-13 04:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(483677, 46460, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hi Koll! <br/>Nice use of subtle lighting and strong use of shadow to create mood. I like that she''s looking into the negative space area - makes one wonder what is there. Composition works well for me. Colour tone is a little pink though.</td>', 'Hi Koll! Nice use of subtle lighting and strong use of shadow to create mood. I like that she''s looking into the negative space area - makes one wonder what is there. Composition works well for me. Colour tone is a little pink though.', '2003-11-13 04:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(483678, 45828, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great idea, pity about the shadows cast by the flash.  Might have been better taken outdoors.</td>', 'Great idea, pity about the shadows cast by the flash.  Might have been better taken outdoors.', '2003-11-13 04:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(483680, 45926, 10170, '<td valign="top">What an extradordinary shot, I love it.</td>', 'What an extradordinary shot, I love it.', '2003-11-13 04:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(483681, 46563, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, with the exception of the sky, which pulls it down somewhat. It''s a little bright and bland to complement the rich colours of the foliage.</td>', 'A lovely image, with the exception of the sky, which pulls it down somewhat. It''s a little bright and bland to complement the rich colours of the foliage.', '2003-11-13 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(483682, 46615, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, interesting lighting. Great shapes along the egde of the leaf.</td>', 'Nice composition, interesting lighting. Great shapes along the egde of the leaf.', '2003-11-13 04:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483683, 45926, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is growing on me - like the graduated purple tones - good use of empty space.</td>', 'This is growing on me - like the graduated purple tones - good use of empty space.', '2003-11-13 04:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
