(483695, 46609, 10170, '<td valign="top">The focus here really makes it.  Nice work.</td>', 'The focus here really makes it.  Nice work.', '2003-11-13 04:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(483696, 46603, 10170, '<td valign="top">If you live where it looks like you do then I am too jealous for words!  Nice photo, the tones work well.</td>', 'If you live where it looks like you do then I am too jealous for words!  Nice photo, the tones work well.', '2003-11-13 04:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(483697, 46363, 10170, '<td valign="top">Timing here is perfect and the brown tones work very well.  Nice work.</td>', 'Timing here is perfect and the brown tones work very well.  Nice work.', '2003-11-13 04:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483698, 46676, 14017, '<td valign="top">Perfect expression on her face! 9</td>', 'Perfect expression on her face! 9', '2003-11-13 04:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(483699, 45877, 3087, '<td valign="top">...sailors take warning. That''s the proverb, though I can''t say I''m familiar with the book.<br/>I like this image a lot - mainly because of the great curve of red beneath the sun - what a great shape. Clouds and sky colour are good too.<br/>Image quality seems rather ... textured - I''m trying to think of a better word for it but... hopefully you''ll understand what I mean?</td>', '...sailors take warning. That''s the proverb, though I can''t say I''m familiar with the book.I like this image a lot - mainly because of the great curve of red beneath the sun - what a great shape. Clouds and sky colour are good too.Image quality seems rather ... textured - I''m trying to think of a better word for it but... hopefully you''ll understand what I mean?', '2003-11-13 04:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(483700, 46103, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  How about more of the dog, postioned a third from bottom left, a third up?  He/she seems a bit incidental in this composition.</td>', 'Nice idea.  How about more of the dog, postioned a third from bottom left, a third up?  He/she seems a bit incidental in this composition.', '2003-11-13 04:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(483701, 46647, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  You habe managed to give this a very effective aged look.</td>', 'Excellent.  You habe managed to give this a very effective aged look.', '2003-11-13 04:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(483702, 46177, 14017, '<td valign="top">Nice concept!!! Great lighting.</td>', 'Nice concept!!! Great lighting.', '2003-11-13 04:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(483703, 46172, 3087, '<td valign="top">How strange - talk about the powers of suggestion - I look intot he fire and can see the lower area of a face with nostrils and mouth and part of the jaw line. Is that why you entered it or is it just coincidence and suggestiveness?<br/>:o)<br/>Nice image, with good use of foliage to frame.</td>', 'How strange - talk about the powers of suggestion - I look intot he fire and can see the lower area of a face with nostrils and mouth and part of the jaw line. Is that why you entered it or is it just coincidence and suggestiveness?:o)Nice image, with good use of foliage to frame.', '2003-11-13 04:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(483704, 46302, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great, just a fantastic shot. I think it was a fantastic choice do it in B&amp;W. I think it´s one of the best pictures of the challenge. 10</td>', 'Great, just a fantastic shot. I think it was a fantastic choice do it in B&W. I think it´s one of the best pictures of the challenge. 10', '2003-11-13 04:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(483705, 46548, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The way he''s holding the brush seems a little odd and focus seems soft. Could do with moving the crate a touch to the right - I think it would strengthen composition a touch.</td>', 'Nicely done. The way he''s holding the brush seems a little odd and focus seems soft. Could do with moving the crate a touch to the right - I think it would strengthen composition a touch.', '2003-11-13 04:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483706, 45769, 14017, '<td valign="top">nice concept! but the hands don''t look like they''re "catching" it. They''re merely holding it.</td>', 'nice concept! but the hands don''t look like they''re "catching" it. They''re merely holding it.', '2003-11-13 04:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(483707, 45793, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh I like this - what a cool use of DOF and the macro really brings out the detail of the design as well as some wonderful colours.</td>', 'Oooh I like this - what a cool use of DOF and the macro really brings out the detail of the design as well as some wonderful colours.', '2003-11-13 04:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483708, 46601, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, not quite so sure about the composition - nice clear focus.</td>', 'Brilliant idea, not quite so sure about the composition - nice clear focus.', '2003-11-13 04:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(483709, 46570, 3087, '<td valign="top">Yep, I like this composition a lot, colour is great - Heinlein is always orange to me, maybe that''s because of all his ginger haired characters? I like the receding line of trees, the mistiness behind him and the glares of light. Only thing I''d like is for the lower glare to be more orange and less white.</td>', 'Yep, I like this composition a lot, colour is great - Heinlein is always orange to me, maybe that''s because of all his ginger haired characters? I like the receding line of trees, the mistiness behind him and the glares of light. Only thing I''d like is for the lower glare to be more orange and less white.', '2003-11-13 04:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483710, 46419, 14017, '<td valign="top">I don''t know but I just love looking at it. it''s like a great painting!!! 9</td>', 'I don''t know but I just love looking at it. it''s like a great painting!!! 9', '2003-11-13 04:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(483712, 46670, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and exposure and I do like the background. Just the right amount of foreground rock included too.  I''m not sure whether the decision to have the sword off-centre horizontally was deliberate - if so I think it needs to be more off centre than it is. As it is now it just looks as though you''d intended to centre it and hadn''t quite achieved that.</td>', 'Nice lighting and exposure and I do like the background. Just the right amount of foreground rock included too.  I''m not sure whether the decision to have the sword off-centre horizontally was deliberate - if so I think it needs to be more off centre than it is. As it is now it just looks as though you''d intended to centre it and hadn''t quite achieved that.', '2003-11-13 04:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483714, 46610, 3087, '<td valign="top">This one is definitely surreal. I can''t say I know the book but I''m assuming it refers to a little metal bell than rings rather than a salad ingredient? :o) Made me smile though!</td>', 'This one is definitely surreal. I can''t say I know the book but I''m assuming it refers to a little metal bell than rings rather than a salad ingredient? :o) Made me smile though!', '2003-11-13 04:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(483715, 46616, 14017, '<td valign="top">Pretty!!! Fantastic lighting!</td>', 'Pretty!!! Fantastic lighting!', '2003-11-13 04:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(483716, 46652, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great sky colour, nice sweeping feel to the sand. Good composition. Horizon feels tilted, almost curved even?</td>', 'Great sky colour, nice sweeping feel to the sand. Good composition. Horizon feels tilted, almost curved even?', '2003-11-13 04:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(483717, 46418, 3087, '<td valign="top">This isn''t weird at all. No really. Let me get you your meds now.<br/>Seems very pixelly but I can''t tell whether that''s just the weird texture confusing my eyes and brain! (Isn''t difficult to confuse them!). <br/>Why did you take a photo of a dead chick? What is that in it''s mouth?</td>', 'This isn''t weird at all. No really. Let me get you your meds now.Seems very pixelly but I can''t tell whether that''s just the weird texture confusing my eyes and brain! (Isn''t difficult to confuse them!). Why did you take a photo of a dead chick? What is that in it''s mouth?', '2003-11-13 04:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(483718, 46613, 8643, '<td valign="top">This shouts out of the screen - how did you do that?</td>', 'This shouts out of the screen - how did you do that?', '2003-11-13 04:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(483719, 45926, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image very much, though I can''t relate it easily to the story.</td>', 'I like the image very much, though I can''t relate it easily to the story.', '2003-11-13 04:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(483720, 46649, 3087, '<td valign="top">I happened to see the other similar rendition first so that got all my ho ho ho for this idea. (I''m not voting so you don''t get marked down for that). Lighting isn''t very good - too much glare on that white cloth and too messy an arrangement but I imagine you were more concerned with the humour anyway? :o)</td>', 'I happened to see the other similar rendition first so that got all my ho ho ho for this idea. (I''m not voting so you don''t get marked down for that). Lighting isn''t very good - too much glare on that white cloth and too messy an arrangement but I imagine you were more concerned with the humour anyway? :o)', '2003-11-13 04:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(483721, 46589, 14017, '<td valign="top">Is it supposed to be blood? It looks so fake. (Jelly?)</td>', 'Is it supposed to be blood? It looks so fake. (Jelly?)', '2003-11-13 04:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(483722, 46600, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the blurred movement capture and the extensive darkness. A little too orange is my only negative.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the blurred movement capture and the extensive darkness. A little too orange is my only negative.', '2003-11-13 04:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
