(484265, 46401, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, so clear and sharp, beautiful colors as well, this one definately stands out in the crowd.  I give it a 10!</td>', 'Beautiful picture, so clear and sharp, beautiful colors as well, this one definately stands out in the crowd.  I give it a 10!', '2003-11-13 14:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(484268, 46423, 6668, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what the object in the whole in the tree is, now I''m curious?? :-)</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what the object in the whole in the tree is, now I''m curious?? :-)', '2003-11-13 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(484269, 46616, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition, the only thing at it is a very small thing and I am totally nitpicking here is the hang nail on the middle finger, it makes me want to reach in with my nail clippers and clip it!!! LOL...but like I said that is a very small thing!! 8</td>', 'Nice idea and composition, the only thing at it is a very small thing and I am totally nitpicking here is the hang nail on the middle finger, it makes me want to reach in with my nail clippers and clip it!!! LOL...but like I said that is a very small thing!! 8', '2003-11-13 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484270, 46428, 6668, '<td valign="top">Is that honeydew melon and peaches? maybe nectarines? I thought of doing this book to but changed my mind at the last minute. Creative idea, but I personally think it would have been better if you had used real eggs colored with food coloring. 7</td>', 'Is that honeydew melon and peaches? maybe nectarines? I thought of doing this book to but changed my mind at the last minute. Creative idea, but I personally think it would have been better if you had used real eggs colored with food coloring. 7', '2003-11-13 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(484280, 46204, 13136, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. The best so far. I can''t wait to read how you did this one.</td>', 'Excellent photo. The best so far. I can''t wait to read how you did this one.', '2003-11-13 14:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(484282, 46616, 10702, '<td valign="top">Good job, like the colors and the DOF, very nice.</td>', 'Good job, like the colors and the DOF, very nice.', '2003-11-13 14:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(484283, 45769, 13136, '<td valign="top">This is a title I wanted to do, but with a different concept. I like yours.</td>', 'This is a title I wanted to do, but with a different concept. I like yours.', '2003-11-13 14:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(484285, 45825, 13136, '<td valign="top">Ha! Subtle.</td>', 'Ha! Subtle.', '2003-11-13 14:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(484286, 46277, 13136, '<td valign="top">Too much light in the back, not enough in the front. Cat IN the hat?</td>', 'Too much light in the back, not enough in the front. Cat IN the hat?', '2003-11-13 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(484288, 46122, 13136, '<td valign="top">Great! got the title right away from the picture. Interesting effects.</td>', 'Great! got the title right away from the picture. Interesting effects.', '2003-11-13 14:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(484293, 46396, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice, watersplash photos are always fun to look at.</td>', 'Nice, watersplash photos are always fun to look at.', '2003-11-13 14:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484295, 46416, 13136, '<td valign="top">Dutch = Double? I assume this was intentional, but it''s too jarring to look at.</td>', 'Dutch = Double? I assume this was intentional, but it''s too jarring to look at.', '2003-11-13 14:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(484299, 46664, 10799, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for this book title.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice idea for this book title.  Well done.', '2003-11-13 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(484318, 46642, 11800, '<td valign="top">The choice of focus is the best thing about this photo. Brilliant. And then the color adds a silence to the image and lets us enter into this intimate moment in time. The only things I think could be improved is the tilt of the picture, it seems to be leaning over to the left. The title says all that has to be said about the picture so I feel the sign distracts and might cause the viewer to feel stupid, as if we aren''t smart enough to get the connection. But maybe I am. ;o</td>', 'The choice of focus is the best thing about this photo. Brilliant. And then the color adds a silence to the image and lets us enter into this intimate moment in time. The only things I think could be improved is the tilt of the picture, it seems to be leaning over to the left. The title says all that has to be said about the picture so I feel the sign distracts and might cause the viewer to feel stupid, as if we aren''t smart enough to get the connection. But maybe I am. ;o', '2003-11-13 15:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(484322, 46489, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute. Good dof. Am I missing something? How do you relate a goose with a king? It will not affect your score one way or the other, curious is all.</td>', 'Cute. Good dof. Am I missing something? How do you relate a goose with a king? It will not affect your score one way or the other, curious is all.', '2003-11-13 15:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(484327, 46606, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like seeing photos displayed at the appropiate size for their resolution. Nice job. Don''t listen to those that might say it''s too small. I might like to see this with more saturation and contrast.</td>', 'I like seeing photos displayed at the appropiate size for their resolution. Nice job. Don''t listen to those that might say it''s too small. I might like to see this with more saturation and contrast.', '2003-11-13 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484329, 46396, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, contrast and focus. Title fits, too.</td>', 'Nice lighting, contrast and focus. Title fits, too.', '2003-11-13 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(484332, 46089, 8328, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2003-11-13 15:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(484333, 46128, 11800, '<td valign="top">I was going to say it was soft, but I can see he''s taken thru a fence. You did better than I could to blur it.</td>', 'I was going to say it was soft, but I can see he''s taken thru a fence. You did better than I could to blur it.', '2003-11-13 15:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(484334, 46517, 8328, '<td valign="top">The oranges captured in the sky are spectacular... beautiful.</td>', 'The oranges captured in the sky are spectacular... beautiful.', '2003-11-13 15:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484335, 46390, 8328, '<td valign="top">Nice colors...</td>', 'Nice colors...', '2003-11-13 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(484338, 46452, 11800, '<td valign="top">I want to laugh at this, but find I''m not able to. Did you try rotating it clockwise so it looks more like he''s sailing out into open blue? Might not work because he''s so high.  It''s ok but not a "wow" photo.</td>', 'I want to laugh at this, but find I''m not able to. Did you try rotating it clockwise so it looks more like he''s sailing out into open blue? Might not work because he''s so high.  It''s ok but not a "wow" photo.', '2003-11-13 15:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(484339, 46419, 208, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done here. It took me a second or two to figure it out, but it was worth it. Nice color and composition. I also like the texture that''s here. 9</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done here. It took me a second or two to figure it out, but it was worth it. Nice color and composition. I also like the texture that''s here. 9', '2003-11-13 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(484342, 45678, 11800, '<td valign="top">You would not have lost much information if you had cropped out the dark corners. It would improve the perceived quality of the picture. Nice concept.</td>', 'You would not have lost much information if you had cropped out the dark corners. It would improve the perceived quality of the picture. Nice concept.', '2003-11-13 15:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(484343, 46131, 208, '<td valign="top">Very good idea. I like the composition, though the shadows are a bit too much. The smile on the serf''s face is hilarious. (BTW, I wish I could have come up with something for "Shampoo Planet.") 7</td>', 'Very good idea. I like the composition, though the shadows are a bit too much. The smile on the serf''s face is hilarious. (BTW, I wish I could have come up with something for "Shampoo Planet.") 7', '2003-11-13 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(484346, 46088, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute and funny. Plus the lighting is good. Love the attack cat! 8</td>', 'Cute and funny. Plus the lighting is good. Love the attack cat! 8', '2003-11-13 15:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(484347, 46446, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice velvet texture and dof.  The only negative is the  leaf at bottom doesn''t help the photo at all.  I would have cropped the rose more tightly, its so beautiful, why add a bad modifier.</td>', 'Nice velvet texture and dof.  The only negative is the  leaf at bottom doesn''t help the photo at all.  I would have cropped the rose more tightly, its so beautiful, why add a bad modifier.', '2003-11-13 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(484349, 45693, 208, '<td valign="top">Well this certainly has nothing at all to do with the book (is that series *ever* going to end?), but it definitely fits for this challenge. I like the contrast of the cars sitting with the motion suggested by the headlights. I like the crop, too. 7</td>', 'Well this certainly has nothing at all to do with the book (is that series *ever* going to end?), but it definitely fits for this challenge. I like the contrast of the cars sitting with the motion suggested by the headlights. I like the crop, too. 7', '2003-11-13 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(484353, 46524, 3569, '<td valign="top">The light pole in the center really takes my eye away from everything else.   If the pole is the subject.  I would have cropped the photo to have the pole off center, possibly the house.</td>', 'The light pole in the center really takes my eye away from everything else.   If the pole is the subject.  I would have cropped the photo to have the pole off center, possibly the house.', '2003-11-13 15:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484354, 46460, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Perhaps too dark by the face, and what is that in front of her?</td>', 'Nice!  Perhaps too dark by the face, and what is that in front of her?', '2003-11-13 16:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484355, 46644, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the bacjground color too.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the bacjground color too.', '2003-11-13 16:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(484356, 46666, 208, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out much of the face, especially compared to the beak. I do like the choice of a black background and your using it for negative space. 7</td>', 'I can''t make out much of the face, especially compared to the beak. I do like the choice of a black background and your using it for negative space. 7', '2003-11-13 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484357, 45828, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, well executed.  Except next time, perhaps shoot outside on a blue sky day or avoid the ceiling light, or use shallow DOF to make sure it''s not detailed.</td>', 'Very nice idea, well executed.  Except next time, perhaps shoot outside on a blue sky day or avoid the ceiling light, or use shallow DOF to make sure it''s not detailed.', '2003-11-13 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(484358, 46661, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you guys surprise me. Here I was, thinking how the light on the glasses are really distracting, but you placed them perfectly. The only thing I would change; should be in portrait orientation to make it more obvious.</td>', 'Sometimes you guys surprise me. Here I was, thinking how the light on the glasses are really distracting, but you placed them perfectly. The only thing I would change; should be in portrait orientation to make it more obvious.', '2003-11-13 16:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484360, 46570, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interestingly great.  The more I look the more I like great job.</td>', 'Interestingly great.  The more I look the more I like great job.', '2003-11-13 16:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(484366, 46563, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like the shot very much.. Did you try less orange, so the grass looked more natural (straw colored).  Anyway good job.</td>', 'I like the shot very much.. Did you try less orange, so the grass looked more natural (straw colored).  Anyway good job.', '2003-11-13 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484378, 46428, 10496, '<td valign="top">What clever eggs!</td>', 'What clever eggs!', '2003-11-13 16:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
