(484382, 46448, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It is simple and beautiful.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It is simple and beautiful.', '2003-11-13 16:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(484384, 46401, 10496, '<td valign="top">There is a sharpness and clarity to this image that is very good. The light and shadow on the walk way create interesting visual interest.</td>', 'There is a sharpness and clarity to this image that is very good. The light and shadow on the walk way create interesting visual interest.', '2003-11-13 16:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484385, 46584, 12253, '<td valign="top">...it will have a crummy ball?  LOL.  Might be improved on on a black background, with a non-logo mouse.  The old white MS mice would be good for this. You got me thinking: a funny one for an old or broken mouse.  Picture of the cookie, a glsas, and the mouse actually in submerged in the glass of milk!</td>', '...it will have a crummy ball?  LOL.  Might be improved on on a black background, with a non-logo mouse.  The old white MS mice would be good for this. You got me thinking: a funny one for an old or broken mouse.  Picture of the cookie, a glsas, and the mouse actually in submerged in the glass of milk!', '2003-11-13 16:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(484386, 46173, 9457, '<td valign="top">Good setup</td>', 'Good setup', '2003-11-13 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(484388, 46585, 9457, '<td valign="top">I would have liked plain background :)</td>', 'I would have liked plain background :)', '2003-11-13 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
