(484589, 45862, 9387, '<td valign="top">While your photo certainly conveys the title that you have chosen it does nothing for me as a photo.  the eye peeping out between all that hair does not enhance the picture.  In fact IMHO all that hair and fur around the neckline is just a cover-up.   I would have had the hair pulled up and out of the way and tried to do a more artsy pose with the whole neck bare so that the pearl stood out as the focus of the photo.</td>', 'While your photo certainly conveys the title that you have chosen it does nothing for me as a photo.  the eye peeping out between all that hair does not enhance the picture.  In fact IMHO all that hair and fur around the neckline is just a cover-up.   I would have had the hair pulled up and out of the way and tried to do a more artsy pose with the whole neck bare so that the pearl stood out as the focus of the photo.', '2003-11-13 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
