(484599, 46629, 9387, '<td valign="top">This picture is so dark, unclear and filled with noise.   I have no idea what your focal point was.  This could have been an alright photo had you gotten something clear.</td>', 'This picture is so dark, unclear and filled with noise.   I have no idea what your focal point was.  This could have been an alright photo had you gotten something clear.', '2003-11-13 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(484604, 46623, 9387, '<td valign="top">While this was a good idea I think it could have been executed better.  First of all the legs on the picture are no longer than a regular torso and if I was trying to portray "daddy long legs" I would have made the leg portion of the picture longer.  However, that is just a comment and had nothing to do with my mark.  The rest of the picture looks very grainy though and not appealing to me.  I would have preferred to see this photo sharper.  Just my opinion though.</td>', 'While this was a good idea I think it could have been executed better.  First of all the legs on the picture are no longer than a regular torso and if I was trying to portray "daddy long legs" I would have made the leg portion of the picture longer.  However, that is just a comment and had nothing to do with my mark.  The rest of the picture looks very grainy though and not appealing to me.  I would have preferred to see this photo sharper.  Just my opinion though.', '2003-11-13 19:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
