(484706, 46302, 11951, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photo.  I would liked to see more of the photo and less of the frame, since space is limited.  I think it may have been more vibrant that way.   Still very nice.</td>', 'What a wonderful photo.  I would liked to see more of the photo and less of the frame, since space is limited.  I think it may have been more vibrant that way.   Still very nice.', '2003-11-13 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
