(484708, 46198, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Almost like a drawing. I think I like it and will look back after the challenge to see if there are any notes. I think I would have desaturated the magenta and made it truly red and black.</td>', 'Interesting. Almost like a drawing. I think I like it and will look back after the challenge to see if there are any notes. I think I would have desaturated the magenta and made it truly red and black.', '2003-11-13 20:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
