(484711, 46541, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice shot of the bird. I like where it is in the picture &amp; it reallys does look lonesome</td>', 'nice shot of the bird. I like where it is in the picture & it reallys does look lonesome', '2003-11-13 20:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
