(484714, 45828, 12268, '<td valign="top">cute shot, nice angle</td>', 'cute shot, nice angle', '2003-11-13 20:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(484715, 46022, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice. It looks like the entire house is burning though.</td>', 'Nice. It looks like the entire house is burning though.', '2003-11-13 20:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(484716, 46416, 7628, '<td valign="top">Perhaps your lack of focus is meant to comment on the kind of headaches one gets in a government building?  Perhaps I should know more about this book to understand the connection to a hotel.  I wish the photo stood ojn its own better.</td>', 'Perhaps your lack of focus is meant to comment on the kind of headaches one gets in a government building?  Perhaps I should know more about this book to understand the connection to a hotel.  I wish the photo stood ojn its own better.', '2003-11-13 20:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(484718, 45698, 7628, '<td valign="top">The book title works well with the photo, and makes a very nice photographic subject.  NIce contrast between the quality of lights, and the structure of the building supports the composition.</td>', 'The book title works well with the photo, and makes a very nice photographic subject.  NIce contrast between the quality of lights, and the structure of the building supports the composition.', '2003-11-13 20:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(484720, 46204, 7628, '<td valign="top">the green makes it very mysterious, and I like the contrast between the smooth lake and the rough, rocky land.  This is sunset? or moonlight? I wish I could see the stars better, they''re cool.  Perhaps with a little selectice processing, you could make the sky''s colors more deep and dramatic.  I''d love to see it.</td>', 'the green makes it very mysterious, and I like the contrast between the smooth lake and the rough, rocky land.  This is sunset? or moonlight? I wish I could see the stars better, they''re cool.  Perhaps with a little selectice processing, you could make the sky''s colors more deep and dramatic.  I''d love to see it.', '2003-11-13 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(484721, 46517, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice intense color of the sun and the dark gray clouds, also the color reflecting on the water. The boat is dead center though. The rule of thirds could have made a better composition.</td>', 'Very nice intense color of the sun and the dark gray clouds, also the color reflecting on the water. The boat is dead center though. The rule of thirds could have made a better composition.', '2003-11-13 20:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(484722, 46417, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. I love the golden reflections off the water</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. I love the golden reflections off the water', '2003-11-13 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(484723, 46220, 12151, '<td valign="top">Good image, but I wish you represented the book more accurately!</td>', 'Good image, but I wish you represented the book more accurately!', '2003-11-13 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(484724, 46523, 7628, '<td valign="top">The expression on this woman''s face is very interesting, and her gesture as she clutches her bag.  I wish there was better focus, or perhaps less blur (faster shutter speed) The background is distracting, doesn''t look like a place called "poker flats"</td>', 'The expression on this woman''s face is very interesting, and her gesture as she clutches her bag.  I wish there was better focus, or perhaps less blur (faster shutter speed) The background is distracting, doesn''t look like a place called "poker flats"', '2003-11-13 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484728, 46589, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the knife almost sticking out of the fram three-dimensionally.  I guess the shallow DOF contibutes to that, but I''d like to see more of the knife "sharp" so to speak, and I''d afraid the blood looks too much like jam, which kind of destroys the fantasy...I''d like to see a re-shoot of this.</td>', 'I like the angle of the knife almost sticking out of the fram three-dimensionally.  I guess the shallow DOF contibutes to that, but I''d like to see more of the knife "sharp" so to speak, and I''d afraid the blood looks too much like jam, which kind of destroys the fantasy...I''d like to see a re-shoot of this.', '2003-11-13 20:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(484729, 46628, 12268, '<td valign="top">super! What did you use to get the spirals?</td>', 'super! What did you use to get the spirals?', '2003-11-13 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(484730, 45891, 12268, '<td valign="top">this matches the title so well. Nice sharp shot of the froggy</td>', 'this matches the title so well. Nice sharp shot of the froggy', '2003-11-13 20:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(484731, 46177, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is the most creative shot in the challenge, IMO. Nice job</td>', 'this is the most creative shot in the challenge, IMO. Nice job', '2003-11-13 20:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484732, 46680, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like the composition &amp; angle. defintiely one of the better chess shots that I have seen on dpc thus far. And as you know, this theme is used often. Good job adding something to it!</td>', 'I like the composition & angle. defintiely one of the better chess shots that I have seen on dpc thus far. And as you know, this theme is used often. Good job adding something to it!', '2003-11-13 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(484733, 45819, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a raelly ncie shot!</td>', 'this is a raelly ncie shot!', '2003-11-13 20:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(484735, 46600, 12268, '<td valign="top">moody shot! I like the softness to it &amp; the sepia colour</td>', 'moody shot! I like the softness to it & the sepia colour', '2003-11-13 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(484736, 46561, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ah, a favorite book of mine, always brings tears to my eyes.  But this picture stand well on its own, and fits well with the title,  It captures the intense look of a baby and the feeling of love and nostalgia that a parent gets holding that little hand.  The hands are an important part of the piece - a contrete connection between the parent and child that is also an abstract connection you can see in the child''s eyes.  Perhaps the hand should be in focus too.  I wish there was more definitiion in the baby''s clothes, so we could see the soft texture, rather than just the bright whiteness which makes the babt''s head seem like it is floating, not connected.  Still brings tears to my eyes to remember...</td>', 'Ah, a favorite book of mine, always brings tears to my eyes.  But this picture stand well on its own, and fits well with the title,  It captures the intense look of a baby and the feeling of love and nostalgia that a parent gets holding that little hand.  The hands are an important part of the piece - a contrete connection between the parent and child that is also an abstract connection you can see in the child''s eyes.  Perhaps the hand should be in focus too.  I wish there was more definitiion in the baby''s clothes, so we could see the soft texture, rather than just the bright whiteness which makes the babt''s head seem like it is floating, not connected.  Still brings tears to my eyes to remember...', '2003-11-13 20:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484738, 46630, 7628, '<td valign="top">The blues are appropriate, makes the raod and the distance seem longer, I also like the curve of the road.</td>', 'The blues are appropriate, makes the raod and the distance seem longer, I also like the curve of the road.', '2003-11-13 20:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(484739, 45870, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sharp, funny, very on topic. 10</td>', 'Sharp, funny, very on topic. 10', '2003-11-13 20:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484740, 46302, 12268, '<td valign="top">love the shape of the clouds the angle and the composition. I wish I had taken this shot!</td>', 'love the shape of the clouds the angle and the composition. I wish I had taken this shot!', '2003-11-13 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(484741, 46647, 9643, '<td valign="top">Just read this one a couple of days ago.  You did a great representation and more importantly the photo stands alone as well in quality and interest. 10</td>', 'Just read this one a couple of days ago.  You did a great representation and more importantly the photo stands alone as well in quality and interest. 10', '2003-11-13 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(484742, 46172, 7628, '<td valign="top">the lack of focus on the subject and the relative focus on the leaves make me feel like I''m spying on this person, which is a bit of what we do when reading a biography.  And I do see faces in the fire... it paints a contemplative moment.  I''d crop on the right to tighten the composition - bring our attention to the center of the fire.  I wonder how it would look sharp?</td>', 'the lack of focus on the subject and the relative focus on the leaves make me feel like I''m spying on this person, which is a bit of what we do when reading a biography.  And I do see faces in the fire... it paints a contemplative moment.  I''d crop on the right to tighten the composition - bring our attention to the center of the fire.  I wonder how it would look sharp?', '2003-11-13 21:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(484748, 46417, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like those goden reflection in the water - lovely organic shapes.  The bird is almost in silouette, so it''s hard to recognize as a bird in the position it is in...ideally (when are conditions ever ideal?)  I''s like to see the neck and head of the bird stretched out.</td>', 'I like those goden reflection in the water - lovely organic shapes.  The bird is almost in silouette, so it''s hard to recognize as a bird in the position it is in...ideally (when are conditions ever ideal?)  I''s like to see the neck and head of the bird stretched out.', '2003-11-13 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(484749, 46395, 7869, '<td valign="top">i love trains, I will mark this one to my favs. perfect shot</td>', 'i love trains, I will mark this one to my favs. perfect shot', '2003-11-13 21:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(484750, 45995, 13735, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic! If this doesn''t win then... !!!<br/> <br/>... then... I''ll become rather suspicious about the criteria that counts!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-20 02:55:49.</i></td>', 'Absolutely fantastic! If this doesn''t win then... !!! ... then... I''ll become rather suspicious about the criteria that counts!!!', '2003-11-13 21:07:36.000000', '2003-11-20 02:55:49.000000', 1),
(484751, 46654, 7628, '<td valign="top">The moonlight on the clouds has a great soft quality to it.  I''d crop a bit more on the bottom, make that diagonal line of clouds fill the frame a bit more.  It would be nice if there were more definition to the moon - a sharp edge and maybe some craters.  But if your expose was for the face of the moon, you might not get the light on the clouds as nicely</td>', 'The moonlight on the clouds has a great soft quality to it.  I''d crop a bit more on the bottom, make that diagonal line of clouds fill the frame a bit more.  It would be nice if there were more definition to the moon - a sharp edge and maybe some craters.  But if your expose was for the face of the moon, you might not get the light on the clouds as nicely', '2003-11-13 21:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(484753, 46644, 13381, '<td valign="top">This picture has fabulous colors.  I like your background and the colorful salsa ingredients, but I wish the tablecloth were a different color, so that it would contrast more with the garlic and onions.</td>', 'This picture has fabulous colors.  I like your background and the colorful salsa ingredients, but I wish the tablecloth were a different color, so that it would contrast more with the garlic and onions.', '2003-11-13 21:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(484754, 46648, 12160, '<td valign="top">This is so hilarious!</td>', 'This is so hilarious!', '2003-11-13 21:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(484757, 46162, 7628, '<td valign="top">This photo tells a story.  Nice effect with the calendar.  The clock the rose the hotel key all are piece to the puzzle - you could get the title of the book without knowing it,  I like the bight red, sparse but bold.</td>', 'This photo tells a story.  Nice effect with the calendar.  The clock the rose the hotel key all are piece to the puzzle - you could get the title of the book without knowing it,  I like the bight red, sparse but bold.', '2003-11-13 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(484758, 46112, 13381, '<td valign="top">The picture itself is nice, though it''s a bit asymmetrical.  A bit cropped off the right would help that part, if you''re interested in symmetry.  But the title isn''t directly reflected in the photo.  Romeo and Juliet did have a lovely balcony scene, but without having read the play or seen the movie, a person couldn''t know that.</td>', 'The picture itself is nice, though it''s a bit asymmetrical.  A bit cropped off the right would help that part, if you''re interested in symmetry.  But the title isn''t directly reflected in the photo.  Romeo and Juliet did have a lovely balcony scene, but without having read the play or seen the movie, a person couldn''t know that.', '2003-11-13 21:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(484759, 46616, 12160, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, nice warm color and composition!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, nice warm color and composition!', '2003-11-13 21:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(484761, 46446, 13381, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good shot.  The rose is in good focus, and the color is beautiful. I''d''ve liked to see a tighter crop, though.</td>', 'This is a pretty good shot.  The rose is in good focus, and the color is beautiful. I''d''ve liked to see a tighter crop, though.', '2003-11-13 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484762, 46676, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I see joy is those eyes!  You caught the chocolate mid-drip.  The shadow from the flash makes this very snap-shot-ish, but the white drape in the back suggest set-up.  Perhaps a more natural setting in the kitchen would be more thematic, and add to our sense of the environment of cooking...</td>', 'Cute.  I see joy is those eyes!  You caught the chocolate mid-drip.  The shadow from the flash makes this very snap-shot-ish, but the white drape in the back suggest set-up.  Perhaps a more natural setting in the kitchen would be more thematic, and add to our sense of the environment of cooking...', '2003-11-13 21:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(484763, 46401, 7869, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and colors. IMO the border ruins the shotn so I''ll give you an =8</td>', 'beautiful light and colors. IMO the border ruins the shotn so I''ll give you an =8', '2003-11-13 21:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(484764, 46492, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. I like the use of lights and the soft focus. Too bad you had to sacrifice those beautiful roses but well... art ask for sacrifices. :):):)</td>', 'Very good photo. I like the use of lights and the soft focus. Too bad you had to sacrifice those beautiful roses but well... art ask for sacrifices. :):):)', '2003-11-13 21:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(484766, 46635, 12160, '<td valign="top">Sure is red and black. Well done.</td>', 'Sure is red and black. Well done.', '2003-11-13 21:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484769, 45825, 7628, '<td valign="top">Creative.  You bumped up the saturation of the reds, and desaturated everything else.  The grainy red on the walls is an artifact of that.  Perhaps you could have positioned the camera higher and composed the shot without the wall.</td>', 'Creative.  You bumped up the saturation of the reds, and desaturated everything else.  The grainy red on the walls is an artifact of that.  Perhaps you could have positioned the camera higher and composed the shot without the wall.', '2003-11-13 21:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(484770, 46660, 12253, '<td valign="top">A difficult setup and shot, well done under the no-editing conditions.</td>', 'A difficult setup and shot, well done under the no-editing conditions.', '2003-11-13 21:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(484771, 46128, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good pose and DOF.  Overall, very good, but the hawk is a little soft.</td>', 'Good pose and DOF.  Overall, very good, but the hawk is a little soft.', '2003-11-13 21:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(484772, 46438, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yes that light off the ocean from high up - you are flying thru the air and the light is so ethereal -fits well with the title - I might have cropped out the window alltogether - would make it seen even more floaty.  Maybe a bit less exposed would bring out even more detail in the clouds?</td>', 'Yes that light off the ocean from high up - you are flying thru the air and the light is so ethereal -fits well with the title - I might have cropped out the window alltogether - would make it seen even more floaty.  Maybe a bit less exposed would bring out even more detail in the clouds?', '2003-11-13 21:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(484773, 46610, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice atmosphere you have created here. I don''t understand why you call the pepper a bell but it might be the fact that I don''t know enough english so I won''t deduct any points for that. Somehow I feel there is something missing or maybe just because I don''t know where to look first as all three objects in the picture require attention just the same. But is just my oppinion and I will still rate it an 8.</td>', 'Very nice atmosphere you have created here. I don''t understand why you call the pepper a bell but it might be the fact that I don''t know enough english so I won''t deduct any points for that. Somehow I feel there is something missing or maybe just because I don''t know where to look first as all three objects in the picture require attention just the same. But is just my oppinion and I will still rate it an 8.', '2003-11-13 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(484774, 46204, 6130, '<td valign="top">Mystical and very good.</td>', 'Mystical and very good.', '2003-11-13 21:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(484775, 46089, 12160, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. Excellent!</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. Excellent!', '2003-11-13 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(484776, 46452, 7628, '<td valign="top">But sweat the TALL stuff.  Nice colors against the sky - would get more of a feeling of height if you cropped in from both sides.</td>', 'But sweat the TALL stuff.  Nice colors against the sky - would get more of a feeling of height if you cropped in from both sides.', '2003-11-13 21:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(484777, 46396, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good stop action, exellent clarity and contrast!</td>', 'Good stop action, exellent clarity and contrast!', '2003-11-13 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(484778, 46173, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very well realized. I wish I couldn''t see that very dark line cutting her body in the first position but anyway is hardly noticeable. 8</td>', 'Very well realized. I wish I couldn''t see that very dark line cutting her body in the first position but anyway is hardly noticeable. 8', '2003-11-13 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(484779, 46251, 12902, '<td valign="top">I like it very much. Maybe you could have got rid of some noise but what do I know?</td>', 'I like it very much. Maybe you could have got rid of some noise but what do I know?', '2003-11-13 21:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484780, 46622, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good macro, excellent concept.  Just wish there was enough DOF to have the eye in focus, and enough light to make it look better than it does.</td>', 'Good macro, excellent concept.  Just wish there was enough DOF to have the eye in focus, and enough light to make it look better than it does.', '2003-11-13 21:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484781, 46320, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird shot!</td>', 'Beautiful bird shot!', '2003-11-13 21:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(484782, 46652, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I like this!  The walkway reaching out to the viewer inviting you to climb up.  The smooth swish of the sand, that soft blue sky with the perfect clouds and that wonderful red top.  Sharp focus, lovely light 10</td>', 'Wow.  I like this!  The walkway reaching out to the viewer inviting you to climb up.  The smooth swish of the sand, that soft blue sky with the perfect clouds and that wonderful red top.  Sharp focus, lovely light 10', '2003-11-13 21:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(484784, 46639, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, colors and lighting.</td>', 'Nice focus, colors and lighting.', '2003-11-13 21:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(484785, 45998, 11800, '<td valign="top">I can feel the wind! Good job. Like the pov.</td>', 'I can feel the wind! Good job. Like the pov.', '2003-11-13 21:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484786, 45891, 7628, '<td valign="top">Does seem sticky - very bright green at little hard to look at (perhaps a bit less light would be better)  Has the feeling of a horizontal photo turned vertical -</td>', 'Does seem sticky - very bright green at little hard to look at (perhaps a bit less light would be better)  Has the feeling of a horizontal photo turned vertical -', '2003-11-13 21:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(484788, 46657, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool - lots of work setting this up!  I love the background - interesting but not distracting.  Wish there was a bit less glare on the far left glass.  A bit wider DOF would make everything tack sharp</td>', 'Cool - lots of work setting this up!  I love the background - interesting but not distracting.  Wish there was a bit less glare on the far left glass.  A bit wider DOF would make everything tack sharp', '2003-11-13 21:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484789, 45769, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!</td>', 'Nice catch!', '2003-11-13 21:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(484791, 46296, 7628, '<td valign="top">Light coming down a well or some other cylander?  Neat effect!  I like the gradient of blue.  Wish it weren''t cropped so close on the right and bottom.</td>', 'Light coming down a well or some other cylander?  Neat effect!  I like the gradient of blue.  Wish it weren''t cropped so close on the right and bottom.', '2003-11-13 21:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(484793, 46417, 6597, '<td valign="top">Like the effects of the water was a good movie also 8</td>', 'Like the effects of the water was a good movie also 8', '2003-11-13 21:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(484794, 46492, 7628, '<td valign="top">ouch,  what is that book about?  I think having the roses a bit more our of focus would work better and maybe have jsut a couple stems to simplify and concentrate on the line on thorns against the dark background.  Background in slightly green - use a color cast tool to remove (or does that desaturate the green in the plants too much?)</td>', 'ouch,  what is that book about?  I think having the roses a bit more our of focus would work better and maybe have jsut a couple stems to simplify and concentrate on the line on thorns against the dark background.  Background in slightly green - use a color cast tool to remove (or does that desaturate the green in the plants too much?)', '2003-11-13 21:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(484795, 46428, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute. I think I would have liked to see green eggs. I know, too literal. But what''s the point of the title, if not to define the picture? 7</td>', 'Cute. I think I would have liked to see green eggs. I know, too literal. But what''s the point of the title, if not to define the picture? 7', '2003-11-13 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
