(484808, 46204, 7869, '<td valign="top">amazing=10</td>', 'amazing=10', '2003-11-13 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(484809, 46679, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the "grim" expression on your princess here.  I liike the composition of her leaning out at the viewer, looking up - creates a nice oval shape, very contained in the black background, and frames the face well,.  I wish her crown weren''t cropped so tight at the top, and I might add a little black space to the left and above, for her to be looking into - the diection of the story kind of...I think it woud work better less grainy too - I don''t mean to sound so critical I just REALLY like what you''ve done here and It has inspired me to see a few more details I''s change. 8</td>', 'I love the "grim" expression on your princess here.  I liike the composition of her leaning out at the viewer, looking up - creates a nice oval shape, very contained in the black background, and frames the face well,.  I wish her crown weren''t cropped so tight at the top, and I might add a little black space to the left and above, for her to be looking into - the diection of the story kind of...I think it woud work better less grainy too - I don''t mean to sound so critical I just REALLY like what you''ve done here and It has inspired me to see a few more details I''s change. 8', '2003-11-13 21:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(484812, 46198, 13432, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colours are blending. It looks like a flower or like a vortex. It drags you in. Nicely done! 9</td>', 'I like the way the colours are blending. It looks like a flower or like a vortex. It drags you in. Nicely done! 9', '2003-11-13 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(484815, 45831, 11800, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is too crooked. It''s really pixelated, the sun doesn''t add anything but a flare. What were you trying to express with this?  <br/>I apologize. If you are a child, find an adult that can help you with your technique. If you are an adult, find someone to help you with your technique and,not to be mean, maybe spend some time looking at some of the past challenges to see what other people like. Look at the ones that didn''t do well and learn what people don''t like. 2</td>', 'Your horizon is too crooked. It''s really pixelated, the sun doesn''t add anything but a flare. What were you trying to express with this?  I apologize. If you are a child, find an adult that can help you with your technique. If you are an adult, find someone to help you with your technique and,not to be mean, maybe spend some time looking at some of the past challenges to see what other people like. Look at the ones that didn''t do well and learn what people don''t like. 2', '2003-11-13 21:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(484816, 46002, 7628, '<td valign="top">great lighting and colors!  Those golden trees and that blue sky!  A bit of glare in the lens, not a big deal.  I like the path coming down to meet the viewer, the lighter line of clouds lower in the sky.  Wish the buildings on the left weren''t there, but they aren''t too distracting. 8</td>', 'great lighting and colors!  Those golden trees and that blue sky!  A bit of glare in the lens, not a big deal.  I like the path coming down to meet the viewer, the lighter line of clouds lower in the sky.  Wish the buildings on the left weren''t there, but they aren''t too distracting. 8', '2003-11-13 21:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(484817, 46050, 4482, '<td valign="top">Original... expect lot of 1s from the prude gallery! ;-) The picture is as wierd as the title so... good job! you''ve created a unique mood to the photo and it works for me! 8</td>', 'Original... expect lot of 1s from the prude gallery! ;-) The picture is as wierd as the title so... good job! you''ve created a unique mood to the photo and it works for me! 8', '2003-11-13 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484819, 46302, 7628, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous B&amp;W  One to hang on the wall next to your Ansel Adams.  nice range of grays. nice composition with differrent layers of depth and brightness. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous B&W  One to hang on the wall next to your Ansel Adams.  nice range of grays. nice composition with differrent layers of depth and brightness. 10', '2003-11-13 21:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(484820, 46363, 4482, '<td valign="top">Original idea! your photo does meet the challenge quite well. I personnaly would''ve cropped it either dead center or using the rule of 3rds. That rule does''nt apply to all shots but ones with lotsa clean negative space... it''s more pleasing to the eye. 7</td>', 'Original idea! your photo does meet the challenge quite well. I personnaly would''ve cropped it either dead center or using the rule of 3rds. That rule does''nt apply to all shots but ones with lotsa clean negative space... it''s more pleasing to the eye. 7', '2003-11-13 21:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(484821, 46521, 11800, '<td valign="top">I love C S Lewis. I have only read a few of the essays from that book. Good representative image.  You might try cropping the sky down almost to the mountains since the top part is washed out.</td>', 'I love C S Lewis. I have only read a few of the essays from that book. Good representative image.  You might try cropping the sky down almost to the mountains since the top part is washed out.', '2003-11-13 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(484822, 45926, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ha! Love it! Visually stunnig!Fits the challenge well and the colors are superbe (not over saturated). Great job 9</td>', 'Ha! Love it! Visually stunnig!Fits the challenge well and the colors are superbe (not over saturated). Great job 9', '2003-11-13 21:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484824, 46565, 4482, '<td valign="top">clean, simple and the shadow casting of the spatula is lovely. 9</td>', 'clean, simple and the shadow casting of the spatula is lovely. 9', '2003-11-13 21:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
