(484833, 46388, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like the coloured shadows cast on the roots and the soft focus. Very nice material you used under the glass ball but IMO distracts a bit from the main subject. 8</td>', 'Very well done. I like the coloured shadows cast on the roots and the soft focus. Very nice material you used under the glass ball but IMO distracts a bit from the main subject. 8', '2003-11-13 22:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(484835, 46197, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good use of the rule of thirds. Nice combination of lights and shadows. Nice feeling to it. I would have loved to see it in colour but it is just me, I am sure. 8</td>', 'Very nice. Good use of the rule of thirds. Nice combination of lights and shadows. Nice feeling to it. I would have loved to see it in colour but it is just me, I am sure. 8', '2003-11-13 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
