(484841, 46369, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I think is the most beautiful photo of a cat I ever seen. You''ve done a beautiful job there, specially because cats don''t pose. I might even think it is more beautiful than my cats but I won''t just because I love them the way they are. But as for the picture... it is perfection to me so it gets a 10. And I can''t wait to add it to my favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful! I think is the most beautiful photo of a cat I ever seen. You''ve done a beautiful job there, specially because cats don''t pose. I might even think it is more beautiful than my cats but I won''t just because I love them the way they are. But as for the picture... it is perfection to me so it gets a 10. And I can''t wait to add it to my favorites.', '2003-11-13 22:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(484842, 46229, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! This was what I had in mind myself. But in my town, the snow has covered everything. I am glad to see that somebody was able to take a picture like this so I treasure it as if it were mine. The picture it is so well realized also that I can''t do anything but give it a 10.</td>', 'Wonderful! This was what I had in mind myself. But in my town, the snow has covered everything. I am glad to see that somebody was able to take a picture like this so I treasure it as if it were mine. The picture it is so well realized also that I can''t do anything but give it a 10.', '2003-11-13 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484847, 45692, 7190, '<td valign="top">nice but the background id too busy</td>', 'nice but the background id too busy', '2003-11-13 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
