(485183, 46302, 12061, '<td valign="top">I love the cloud formations, it really adds to the look and feel of this shot. I think it would help if the photo were brightened up a little more.</td>', 'I love the cloud formations, it really adds to the look and feel of this shot. I think it would help if the photo were brightened up a little more.', '2003-11-14 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(485185, 46488, 12061, '<td valign="top">Whatever look you were going for here just doesn''t work for me ... The colors are way too saturated and the pink toilet just doesn''t look good anyway. The extensive amount of grain is a huge turn off, I''m sorry, this one doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'Whatever look you were going for here just doesn''t work for me ... The colors are way too saturated and the pink toilet just doesn''t look good anyway. The extensive amount of grain is a huge turn off, I''m sorry, this one doesn''t do anything for me.', '2003-11-14 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(485187, 45828, 12061, '<td valign="top">What''s throwing me off is the ceiling...I can totally picture a complete black or white background behind them.</td>', 'What''s throwing me off is the ceiling...I can totally picture a complete black or white background behind them.', '2003-11-14 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(485190, 46655, 10799, '<td valign="top">I wish I could the black object a bit more clearly in this photograph.  It also might work better with less... less might be more in this case with composition.</td>', 'I wish I could the black object a bit more clearly in this photograph.  It also might work better with less... less might be more in this case with composition.', '2003-11-14 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(485191, 46609, 11800, '<td valign="top">There isn''t enough information. Your light seems to be a crystal ball. The dust is the only hint you give that this might be an attic. I think it could be improved by having a little more dof to at least make some of the background more focused. Or maybe a higher pov to get a different angle on the table or whatever it is holding the crystal ball.</td>', 'There isn''t enough information. Your light seems to be a crystal ball. The dust is the only hint you give that this might be an attic. I think it could be improved by having a little more dof to at least make some of the background more focused. Or maybe a higher pov to get a different angle on the table or whatever it is holding the crystal ball.', '2003-11-14 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(485192, 46642, 12061, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, the woman cropped at the top works perfectly. 8</td>', 'lovely shot, the woman cropped at the top works perfectly. 8', '2003-11-14 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
