(485297, 46676, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and a happy picture. The shadows caused by the flash are distracting.  Some ways to avoid shadows: place something thin and white over the flash, move the subject  away from the background, use natural lighting and white board to bounce light back into the picture.</td>', 'Cute kid and a happy picture. The shadows caused by the flash are distracting.  Some ways to avoid shadows: place something thin and white over the flash, move the subject  away from the background, use natural lighting and white board to bounce light back into the picture.', '2003-11-14 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
