(485319, 46451, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m glad not everyone took this so literally. Let me ask you a question. If you were talking to a stranger that didn''t know about the bible and you didn''t have one to show them, how would you describe it? Not just physically describe it, but what it means to you. That is what you should have photographed.  I see the light/dark spots, but they have no meaning.</td>', 'I''m glad not everyone took this so literally. Let me ask you a question. If you were talking to a stranger that didn''t know about the bible and you didn''t have one to show them, how would you describe it? Not just physically describe it, but what it means to you. That is what you should have photographed.  I see the light/dark spots, but they have no meaning.', '2003-11-14 11:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
