(485382, 46664, 7628, '<td valign="top">very nice.  That glowin orange line really pops out of the simple b&amp;w composition, the curve of the diagonal really suggest how the paper is being eaten up.  I like the DOF - havinf the suggestion of more pages in the backgound work well  - 9</td>', 'very nice.  That glowin orange line really pops out of the simple b&w composition, the curve of the diagonal really suggest how the paper is being eaten up.  I like the DOF - havinf the suggestion of more pages in the backgound work well  - 9', '2003-11-14 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
