(485384, 45857, 7628, '<td valign="top">whille it is a cute/funny photo of a kid''s face, I don''t think the title works - yes there are pictures from the movie of Jack Nicholson like this but...On its own the pic has some merit.  The facial expression makes the viewer curious "what is going on?"  pretty sharp, decent composition, I''d like to see more a tiny more space below the chin</td>', 'whille it is a cute/funny photo of a kid''s face, I don''t think the title works - yes there are pictures from the movie of Jack Nicholson like this but...On its own the pic has some merit.  The facial expression makes the viewer curious "what is going on?"  pretty sharp, decent composition, I''d like to see more a tiny more space below the chin', '2003-11-14 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(485387, 46463, 7628, '<td valign="top">concrete representaion of an abstract idea.  Wish the light on the bottom wasn''t so bright - leaves no detail.  Might be a better composition to fill the frame more by making your subject more diagonal.</td>', 'concrete representaion of an abstract idea.  Wish the light on the bottom wasn''t so bright - leaves no detail.  Might be a better composition to fill the frame more by making your subject more diagonal.', '2003-11-14 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(485390, 46057, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this picture.  It feels very British.  Now I look I could have gotten that from the road markings - but the colors say England to me.  I''m not sure what the expectaions are (knowing the story I realize the crumbling monument to the past...)  I think it would be more cohesive cropped in on the barn with the sheep in the fields behind - a vertical composition.  Or actually include the tree on the right - I''d miss that if it were lost.  So scratch the vertical comment - more of a square composition.  What do you think?</td>', 'I like the colors in this picture.  It feels very British.  Now I look I could have gotten that from the road markings - but the colors say England to me.  I''m not sure what the expectaions are (knowing the story I realize the crumbling monument to the past...)  I think it would be more cohesive cropped in on the barn with the sheep in the fields behind - a vertical composition.  Or actually include the tree on the right - I''d miss that if it were lost.  So scratch the vertical comment - more of a square composition.  What do you think?', '2003-11-14 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(485395, 45819, 7628, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too close cropped - I feel like I''m missing some details on the edge - like the subject just doesn''t fit into the composition.  I like the bright red, the silver - shiny clean car.  Title woldn''t work without knowing the story.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too close cropped - I feel like I''m missing some details on the edge - like the subject just doesn''t fit into the composition.  I like the bright red, the silver - shiny clean car.  Title woldn''t work without knowing the story.', '2003-11-14 13:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(485397, 46239, 7628, '<td valign="top">The clouds are gone..what else has gone from your picture?  I like the red roof and the silouetted weather vane, but the colors and details are muted as it the sun had gone behind a cloud.</td>', 'The clouds are gone..what else has gone from your picture?  I like the red roof and the silouetted weather vane, but the colors and details are muted as it the sun had gone behind a cloud.', '2003-11-14 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(485401, 46483, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice complementary colors.  You;ve pushed the saturation a bit too far - see the pink pixels int the blue cloud.  I like the blue light on the landscape - very monotone.  Looking for gold in a barren land.</td>', 'nice complementary colors.  You;ve pushed the saturation a bit too far - see the pink pixels int the blue cloud.  I like the blue light on the landscape - very monotone.  Looking for gold in a barren land.', '2003-11-14 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(485408, 46448, 7628, '<td valign="top">ok I''ve scolded other photos for not fitting with thier title if you don''t know the book, BUT this picture captures the image in my mind when I read that book PERFECTLY.  Very bleak and powerful.  Nice sepia - looks like a period photo.  very nice 10</td>', 'ok I''ve scolded other photos for not fitting with thier title if you don''t know the book, BUT this picture captures the image in my mind when I read that book PERFECTLY.  Very bleak and powerful.  Nice sepia - looks like a period photo.  very nice 10', '2003-11-14 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(485410, 46419, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very abstract. The light bulb, the light coming thru the lightbulb coloring the rough surface... Wish there were less refections in the glass of the bulb, but they aren''t very distracting.  Beyond the colors and textures I don''t get a lot on "meaning." 7</td>', 'Very abstract. The light bulb, the light coming thru the lightbulb coloring the rough surface... Wish there were less refections in the glass of the bulb, but they aren''t very distracting.  Beyond the colors and textures I don''t get a lot on "meaning." 7', '2003-11-14 13:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(485411, 46174, 7628, '<td valign="top">what a face!  Memorable!  Very old-fashioned composition, looks like photos I haveof my grandmother.  Title works well.  Very nice! 10</td>', 'what a face!  Memorable!  Very old-fashioned composition, looks like photos I haveof my grandmother.  Title works well.  Very nice! 10', '2003-11-14 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(485413, 46521, 7628, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!  your eyes get all lost in that vision of mountains and clouds and reflections and by the time you''ve worked your way down the photo yo find yourself on the dock.  Colors and light work well.  I wis the branches on the right weren''t there. 9</td>', 'gorgeous!  your eyes get all lost in that vision of mountains and clouds and reflections and by the time you''ve worked your way down the photo yo find yourself on the dock.  Colors and light work well.  I wis the branches on the right weren''t there. 9', '2003-11-14 13:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(485414, 46641, 7628, '<td valign="top">a terrific face - framed well against the gray shirt and the white background.  Wish the top of his head were included...8</td>', 'a terrific face - framed well against the gray shirt and the white background.  Wish the top of his head were included...8', '2003-11-14 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
