(485544, 45667, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa, you must have been really reaked when you saw this looking in through the letter-box. Surprised there isn''t more camera shake. Oh no, hang on, it''s a border, silly me.<br/> <br/>Good cat photo, well exposed, nice light in the eyes, and a pose that really says ''cat''. I just think thhe border is the most eye-catching thing about the shot by a street, and not a helpful street at that.</td>', 'Whoa, you must have been really reaked when you saw this looking in through the letter-box. Surprised there isn''t more camera shake. Oh no, hang on, it''s a border, silly me. Good cat photo, well exposed, nice light in the eyes, and a pose that really says ''cat''. I just think thhe border is the most eye-catching thing about the shot by a street, and not a helpful street at that.', '2003-11-14 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
