(485614, 45693, 13064, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  I gotta know how you did it!!</td>', 'I really like this one.  I gotta know how you did it!!', '2003-11-14 16:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(485615, 46560, 10227, '<td valign="top">Picture is nice but a little bit streched out of theme!</td>', 'Picture is nice but a little bit streched out of theme!', '2003-11-14 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(485618, 46657, 13064, '<td valign="top">I dont know why I like this so much, the image is not new and is tawdry at first glance, but it dragged me into it, possibly the background held me there. 9</td>', 'I dont know why I like this so much, the image is not new and is tawdry at first glance, but it dragged me into it, possibly the background held me there. 9', '2003-11-14 16:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(485619, 46460, 10227, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast, framing is also xcellent</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast, framing is also xcellent', '2003-11-14 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(485620, 45802, 13064, '<td valign="top">How can I watch Frankenfurter again????</td>', 'How can I watch Frankenfurter again????', '2003-11-14 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(485621, 46585, 6458, '<td valign="top">Yes, there''s nuts. There''s bolts. Why do I want to look at them? Should I be impressed with the layout? That''s about all I can be impressed with. The lighting causes the nuts to blend into the jeans, and it''s hard to see any detail on the bolts.   There''s no drama present here, and more importantly, nothing to say "give me a high score".</td>', 'Yes, there''s nuts. There''s bolts. Why do I want to look at them? Should I be impressed with the layout? That''s about all I can be impressed with. The lighting causes the nuts to blend into the jeans, and it''s hard to see any detail on the bolts.   There''s no drama present here, and more importantly, nothing to say "give me a high score".', '2003-11-14 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(485622, 46447, 10227, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and idea. Lighting is a little dull however</td>', 'Nice composition and idea. Lighting is a little dull however', '2003-11-14 16:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(485625, 46664, 10227, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and realisation. Truly evocative of the book.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful idea and realisation. Truly evocative of the book.', '2003-11-14 16:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(485627, 46668, 6458, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! It''s simple and direct. There''s a bit of noise which is distracting, but not overly so. The DOF works great to set the hearts apart from the base. I especially appreciate the lighting and composition. Good job!</td>', 'I love this shot! It''s simple and direct. There''s a bit of noise which is distracting, but not overly so. The DOF works great to set the hearts apart from the base. I especially appreciate the lighting and composition. Good job!', '2003-11-14 16:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(485628, 46582, 13064, '<td valign="top">Sick mind, but I LIKE it!!!</td>', 'Sick mind, but I LIKE it!!!', '2003-11-14 16:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(485629, 46277, 10227, '<td valign="top">Lighting needs to be improved somewhat...</td>', 'Lighting needs to be improved somewhat...', '2003-11-14 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(485631, 46050, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the best adapted images to your book, although I don''t think that Stark Naked was nearly that attractive. :) Interesting subject lighting. A little more brightness/contrast would might be good.</td>', 'One of the best adapted images to your book, although I don''t think that Stark Naked was nearly that attractive. :) Interesting subject lighting. A little more brightness/contrast would might be good.', '2003-11-14 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(485632, 46651, 6458, '<td valign="top">It''s a bird! It''s a plane! It''s, it''s, it''s... well.. some small subject that feels isolated from the rest of the shot. It''s too noisy and while I love the colour, the rest of the picture holds no attraction for me. Sorry!</td>', 'It''s a bird! It''s a plane! It''s, it''s, it''s... well.. some small subject that feels isolated from the rest of the shot. It''s too noisy and while I love the colour, the rest of the picture holds no attraction for me. Sorry!', '2003-11-14 16:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(485634, 46565, 6458, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lighting. Not entirely pleased by the composition.. I think it would be better with the whole masher? in the frame. Also, it looks like you''ve used neatimage or something similar on the shot as there is banding evident in the grays. This may or may not be my monitor tho.</td>', 'Nice tones and lighting. Not entirely pleased by the composition.. I think it would be better with the whole masher? in the frame. Also, it looks like you''ve used neatimage or something similar on the shot as there is banding evident in the grays. This may or may not be my monitor tho.', '2003-11-14 16:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(485636, 46021, 6458, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple image. Clean and good focus, good DOF.</td>', 'Nice, simple image. Clean and good focus, good DOF.', '2003-11-14 16:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(485637, 45891, 1280, '<td valign="top">He''s a beauty!!!</td>', 'He''s a beauty!!!', '2003-11-14 16:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(485638, 46589, 13064, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh For the want of a little more depth of field.... and bright red blood.. I like the concept and the contrast, althought I cannot look at it for long with the focus like it is.</td>', 'Ohhhh For the want of a little more depth of field.... and bright red blood.. I like the concept and the contrast, althought I cannot look at it for long with the focus like it is.', '2003-11-14 16:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(485639, 46248, 1280, '<td valign="top">I can''t stand it....TOO CUTE!!!! :-)</td>', 'I can''t stand it....TOO CUTE!!!! :-)', '2003-11-14 16:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(485642, 46536, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-11-14 16:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(485643, 46601, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2003-11-14 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(485645, 46507, 6458, '<td valign="top">Washed out colours and uninspired composition.  Cutting off the top of the tower, centering your subject, and leaving the trees in on the right side all hurt this image.</td>', 'Washed out colours and uninspired composition.  Cutting off the top of the tower, centering your subject, and leaving the trees in on the right side all hurt this image.', '2003-11-14 16:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(485651, 46615, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2003-11-14 16:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(485652, 46369, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-11-14 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(485653, 46601, 10227, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but somewhat the perspective is lacking. I probably would have used the arms only...</td>', 'Nice idea, but somewhat the perspective is lacking. I probably would have used the arms only...', '2003-11-14 16:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(485656, 46448, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice Sepia. Steinbeck, I think, would certainly approve.  You have captured well the sad journey of the Joad family forced from their land to seek imagined California riches. Now if you just had a determined turtle crossing the road it would be perfection. :)</td>', 'Nice Sepia. Steinbeck, I think, would certainly approve.  You have captured well the sad journey of the Joad family forced from their land to seek imagined California riches. Now if you just had a determined turtle crossing the road it would be perfection. :)', '2003-11-14 17:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(485657, 46277, 6458, '<td valign="top">This is a good attempt, to be sure. However the lighting is a bit off. I think you should have some light from the front, as well as the top, so we can see more detail in the cat''s fur.</td>', 'This is a good attempt, to be sure. However the lighting is a bit off. I think you should have some light from the front, as well as the top, so we can see more detail in the cat''s fur.', '2003-11-14 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(485659, 46418, 6458, '<td valign="top">Wow. I really have nothing nice to say about this photograph.</td>', 'Wow. I really have nothing nice to say about this photograph.', '2003-11-14 17:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(485666, 46162, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very good. NIce special effect, use of colour. I like that you used a mirror for the base really adds depth to what could have been a basic image without the extra dimension.  10</td>', 'Very good. NIce special effect, use of colour. I like that you used a mirror for the base really adds depth to what could have been a basic image without the extra dimension.  10', '2003-11-14 17:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(485671, 46589, 9411, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite work. THe focus is off. Compostition is good and I like the use of red w/ what is basically a black and white shot.<br/>I also think that Sun-Tzu''s work was much more about subtleties, planning and taking advantage of propitious moments. This image would be better suited for a Steven King type novel.   4</td>', 'Doesn''t quite work. THe focus is off. Compostition is good and I like the use of red w/ what is basically a black and white shot.I also think that Sun-Tzu''s work was much more about subtleties, planning and taking advantage of propitious moments. This image would be better suited for a Steven King type novel.   4', '2003-11-14 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(485672, 46673, 9411, '<td valign="top">Painted with a laser? Good idea, but not a real "wow" type image.  5</td>', 'Painted with a laser? Good idea, but not a real "wow" type image.  5', '2003-11-14 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(485673, 46002, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like the red border. Good colours. Unfortunately the reflection dots detract from the overall image.  6</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like the red border. Good colours. Unfortunately the reflection dots detract from the overall image.  6', '2003-11-14 17:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(485674, 46648, 9411, '<td valign="top">With those eyes I doubt that book will be much help.  Possibly next time use a more diffused light source to help eliminate the dreaded red eye effect.  4</td>', 'With those eyes I doubt that book will be much help.  Possibly next time use a more diffused light source to help eliminate the dreaded red eye effect.  4', '2003-11-14 17:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(485678, 46429, 9411, '<td valign="top">The focus is distracting to me in this shot. Either sharper or softer. Colour is good, composition works.  A neater background would be helpful also. 4</td>', 'The focus is distracting to me in this shot. Either sharper or softer. Colour is good, composition works.  A neater background would be helpful also. 4', '2003-11-14 17:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(485682, 46651, 9411, '<td valign="top">Took me a bit to catch on to this one.  The noise is distracting. Composition is good. 4</td>', 'Took me a bit to catch on to this one.  The noise is distracting. Composition is good. 4', '2003-11-14 17:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
