(485730, 46417, 2158, '<td valign="top">That water looks absolutedly wonderful.  I just wish you''d tried for a more side-on view of the bird so one could see it''s head better.</td>', 'That water looks absolutedly wonderful.  I just wish you''d tried for a more side-on view of the bird so one could see it''s head better.', '2003-11-14 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
