(485841, 46438, 11800, '<td valign="top">I was about to impose my ideas onto our picture. I''m glad I stopped myself. I like the wing and light. And if flying isn''t a symbol for lightness, I don''t know what is.</td>', 'I was about to impose my ideas onto our picture. I''m glad I stopped myself. I like the wing and light. And if flying isn''t a symbol for lightness, I don''t know what is.', '2003-11-14 20:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
