(485982, 46649, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very cute and amazing.  Nice example of creativity.</td>', 'Very cute and amazing.  Nice example of creativity.', '2003-11-14 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(485986, 46396, 13728, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of my favorites.  How many did you have to take to get the right one?</td>', 'Great shot, one of my favorites.  How many did you have to take to get the right one?', '2003-11-14 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(485987, 46177, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very clever, and nice lighting effect</td>', 'Very clever, and nice lighting effect', '2003-11-14 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(485988, 46363, 13728, '<td valign="top">Haven''t heard of this book but that is a great picture.  How did you do it?</td>', 'Haven''t heard of this book but that is a great picture.  How did you do it?', '2003-11-14 23:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(486007, 45822, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and the yellow line certainly draws one into the scene.  My only comment would be that if the sky had cooperated with you the scene would have looked a little better, but all in all a good job.</td>', 'I like the picture and the yellow line certainly draws one into the scene.  My only comment would be that if the sky had cooperated with you the scene would have looked a little better, but all in all a good job.', '2003-11-15 01:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(486008, 46600, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the picture very much.  The tone of the shot is very well done.</td>', 'I like the picture very much.  The tone of the shot is very well done.', '2003-11-15 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(486009, 46097, 9387, '<td valign="top">This looks like my favorite spot on the Cape but I''m sure it''s not.  I like the picture a lot.  My only comment would be to try and get it a little sharper next time.  By the way on my monitor the sky looks very strange.  Almost like you drew it on there with flat brush strokes.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a sky like that.</td>', 'This looks like my favorite spot on the Cape but I''m sure it''s not.  I like the picture a lot.  My only comment would be to try and get it a little sharper next time.  By the way on my monitor the sky looks very strange.  Almost like you drew it on there with flat brush strokes.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a sky like that.', '2003-11-15 01:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(486010, 46547, 9387, '<td valign="top">Like the photo and in this case I like the frame.  I think without it the picture would be a little flat.  The red of the parachute is great and I like the composition.  Do I dare ask where you were when you took this. LOL</td>', 'Like the photo and in this case I like the frame.  I think without it the picture would be a little flat.  The red of the parachute is great and I like the composition.  Do I dare ask where you were when you took this. LOL', '2003-11-15 01:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486013, 45926, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but I''m not sure why.  Like the background color.  The trees stand out.  Composition is very good.  I think the thing that makes me uneasy is the cube.  Can''t tell you why but I look at it with suspicion even though I am reading right above me that the picture has been validated.  I do like it though but just can''t tell you why.  I gave you an above average rating.</td>', 'I like the picture but I''m not sure why.  Like the background color.  The trees stand out.  Composition is very good.  I think the thing that makes me uneasy is the cube.  Can''t tell you why but I look at it with suspicion even though I am reading right above me that the picture has been validated.  I do like it though but just can''t tell you why.  I gave you an above average rating.', '2003-11-15 01:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(486015, 46574, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is the second time for me through my photos that I marked.  I am taking a good look at your photo and I''m moving it up one mark from the above average one that I gave it originally.  I like it very much.  I like the mood that the background sets and I like the way you have the beach illuminated.  To me it is a very good photo.  Good work.</td>', 'This is the second time for me through my photos that I marked.  I am taking a good look at your photo and I''m moving it up one mark from the above average one that I gave it originally.  I like it very much.  I like the mood that the background sets and I like the way you have the beach illuminated.  To me it is a very good photo.  Good work.', '2003-11-15 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486016, 46642, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  It is an unusual shot and done very well.  The composition is good and so is the color tone.  I like where you cropped the face.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  It is an unusual shot and done very well.  The composition is good and so is the color tone.  I like where you cropped the face.', '2003-11-15 01:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(486017, 46541, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the photo and how it ties in with your book title, but since the color tones are all the same the bird does not really stand out.  Everything sort of blends in together which is good sometimes but not necessarily when you have a real point of focus like the bird.  All in all it is a good shot though and I gave you an above average mark.</td>', 'I like the photo and how it ties in with your book title, but since the color tones are all the same the bird does not really stand out.  Everything sort of blends in together which is good sometimes but not necessarily when you have a real point of focus like the bird.  All in all it is a good shot though and I gave you an above average mark.', '2003-11-15 01:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486018, 46302, 9387, '<td valign="top">There is nothing to say except that I love it and feel like I am standing in the picture.  Good job!</td>', 'There is nothing to say except that I love it and feel like I am standing in the picture.  Good job!', '2003-11-15 01:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(486019, 46223, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great photo and great book.  He is one of my favorite authors.  Anyway, the detail of the jewelry on the vase is extremely well done as is the whole photo.  Good composition and great subject.</td>', 'Great photo and great book.  He is one of my favorite authors.  Anyway, the detail of the jewelry on the vase is extremely well done as is the whole photo.  Good composition and great subject.', '2003-11-15 01:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486021, 45678, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is a great view of a bridge (whether it''s in Turkey or not).  I like the composition and the color, but it seems you got your finger (or soemthing) in the upper left hand corner.  I realize that we are not allowed to spot edit but you might have tried cropping it out.  Still a very good shot and I gave you above average for your score.</td>', 'This is a great view of a bridge (whether it''s in Turkey or not).  I like the composition and the color, but it seems you got your finger (or soemthing) in the upper left hand corner.  I realize that we are not allowed to spot edit but you might have tried cropping it out.  Still a very good shot and I gave you above average for your score.', '2003-11-15 01:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(486022, 46284, 9387, '<td valign="top">I love old torn down buildings like this and yours is no exception.  Great shot, good composition and I like it in black and white.</td>', 'I love old torn down buildings like this and yours is no exception.  Great shot, good composition and I like it in black and white.', '2003-11-15 01:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(486023, 45905, 13781, '<td valign="top">awe..:) i want to be a part of this family.</td>', 'awe..:) i want to be a part of this family.', '2003-11-15 01:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(486024, 46564, 9387, '<td valign="top">A good shot and a good book.  Great clarity on the thimble and the needle.  Good job.</td>', 'A good shot and a good book.  Great clarity on the thimble and the needle.  Good job.', '2003-11-15 01:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(486025, 46401, 9387, '<td valign="top">Like this photo a lot.  Good composition, good clarity, and nice tonal range.</td>', 'Like this photo a lot.  Good composition, good clarity, and nice tonal range.', '2003-11-15 01:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(486026, 46551, 9387, '<td valign="top">After studying your photo again I am raising the score from a 7 to an 9.  I really like this a lot.  The tones are very warm and pleasing.  Good composition and depth of field.  Good detail in the shadows.  Very well done.</td>', 'After studying your photo again I am raising the score from a 7 to an 9.  I really like this a lot.  The tones are very warm and pleasing.  Good composition and depth of field.  Good detail in the shadows.  Very well done.', '2003-11-15 01:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486028, 46538, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good detail in the photo.  Textures come up strong and the torquoise necklace really draws you in.  Like it a lot.</td>', 'Very good detail in the photo.  Textures come up strong and the torquoise necklace really draws you in.  Like it a lot.', '2003-11-15 01:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486035, 46678, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful capture!  Love the soft feel of this shot!  10</td>', 'Very beautiful capture!  Love the soft feel of this shot!  10', '2003-11-15 01:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486036, 46167, 10673, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured &amp; executed.  10</td>', 'Wonderfully captured & executed.  10', '2003-11-15 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(486039, 46417, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured!  10</td>', 'Beautifully captured!  10', '2003-11-15 02:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
