(486216, 46410, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very,very good and clever.</td>', 'Very,very good and clever.', '2003-11-15 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486222, 46057, 13047, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have been really great if you had done two things- angled your lense up and to the right and from a lower perspective. This would have eliminated the distracting road and telephone pole and created an almost diagonal foreground and given the photo an amazing amount of depth. Hope this critique helps.</td>', 'I think this photo would have been really great if you had done two things- angled your lense up and to the right and from a lower perspective. This would have eliminated the distracting road and telephone pole and created an almost diagonal foreground and given the photo an amazing amount of depth. Hope this critique helps.', '2003-11-15 13:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486226, 46616, 14211, '<td valign="top">I score this photo 10 out of 10. The imagery captures the title of the book in an authentic way;  i.e., the ring is a symbol of fellowship as strong as a steel chain</td>', 'I score this photo 10 out of 10. The imagery captures the title of the book in an authentic way;  i.e., the ring is a symbol of fellowship as strong as a steel chain', '2003-11-15 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(486242, 46198, 10848, '<td valign="top">very dramatic colors, great capture on this one, it is a different approach to this title, I like it</td>', 'very dramatic colors, great capture on this one, it is a different approach to this title, I like it', '2003-11-15 14:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(486244, 46664, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo.<br/>Good job on the lighting, getting good exposure on the fore- and background well and to hold the glow in the small flames must have been a bit of work. I like it how you composed this, as well as the aperture choice. Good clean, detailed and good sharp text.  When I think about my Before and After photo, I had a hard time to get the edges of the text right.....<br/>I''ve read this book for my English exam (I''m Dutch) and enjoyed it. Good choice, good job!</td>', 'Great photo.Good job on the lighting, getting good exposure on the fore- and background well and to hold the glow in the small flames must have been a bit of work. I like it how you composed this, as well as the aperture choice. Good clean, detailed and good sharp text.  When I think about my Before and After photo, I had a hard time to get the edges of the text right.....I''ve read this book for my English exam (I''m Dutch) and enjoyed it. Good choice, good job!', '2003-11-15 14:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(486245, 46657, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love the blue, the different sizes and shapes of the glasses adds to this shot also, and the background is a great choice it adds the touch of texture that accentuates this shot, I like it ( 9 )</td>', 'This is great!  I love the blue, the different sizes and shapes of the glasses adds to this shot also, and the background is a great choice it adds the touch of texture that accentuates this shot, I like it ( 9 )', '2003-11-15 14:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486247, 46460, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, toning, pose and use of space.<br/>Just enough detail in the shadows to keep that fatale darkness without loosing subject detail. Good work. Tasteful nudity.<br/>Would have liked to see some more detail on the gun (blown highlight), but that''s just a small detail. <br/></td>', 'Nice lighting, toning, pose and use of space.Just enough detail in the shadows to keep that fatale darkness without loosing subject detail. Good work. Tasteful nudity.Would have liked to see some more detail on the gun (blown highlight), but that''s just a small detail. ', '2003-11-15 14:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486248, 45729, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a interesting shot to me, simple yet dramatic with the red background, I like the crop choice here also, adds height to the needle ( which I am sure was your intention)perfect lighting no glare on the needle itself, which at this close I am sure was difficult. good job!</td>', 'This is a interesting shot to me, simple yet dramatic with the red background, I like the crop choice here also, adds height to the needle ( which I am sure was your intention)perfect lighting no glare on the needle itself, which at this close I am sure was difficult. good job!', '2003-11-15 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(486250, 46174, 10848, '<td valign="top">Well the title suits this shot perfectly ! She is certainly a little princess for sure. Love the facial expression, like ok guys...enough..now can we play? ha ha ..anyway great shot I love it!</td>', 'Well the title suits this shot perfectly ! She is certainly a little princess for sure. Love the facial expression, like ok guys...enough..now can we play? ha ha ..anyway great shot I love it!', '2003-11-15 14:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(486252, 46251, 10848, '<td valign="top">Very spooky, title suits it perfectly, great capture ( 8 )</td>', 'Very spooky, title suits it perfectly, great capture ( 8 )', '2003-11-15 14:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(486255, 46447, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is great, I like the way you captured this in the net, with the shells and sand as if it was pulled in from the sea, very good shot  I like it</td>', 'This is great, I like the way you captured this in the net, with the shells and sand as if it was pulled in from the sea, very good shot  I like it', '2003-11-15 14:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(486257, 46040, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great work, love the composition and how you filled the frame. The choice of that small borderline with transparent edges is great, it helps to draw the eye into the frame.<br/>Good lighting, good deep black background and good detail in the foreground. The red and black work great together. Did you desaturate anything but the reds or does the card look as I see it here?<br/>Minor flaw is perhaps a bit of oversharpening on the rose''s petal edges. But that could also be some jpeg artifacts, because I see some jpeg compression block patterns in the rose detail as well.<br/>Great pic. 10.</td>', 'Great work, love the composition and how you filled the frame. The choice of that small borderline with transparent edges is great, it helps to draw the eye into the frame.Good lighting, good deep black background and good detail in the foreground. The red and black work great together. Did you desaturate anything but the reds or does the card look as I see it here?Minor flaw is perhaps a bit of oversharpening on the rose''s petal edges. But that could also be some jpeg artifacts, because I see some jpeg compression block patterns in the rose detail as well.Great pic. 10.', '2003-11-15 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486258, 46561, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is adorable, I like the way the baby is grasping the adults hand, and the intent look on the baby''s face as if it is listening with a great deal of interest.  The miracle of life always makes me happy and to see it displayed like this is wonderful This is great ( 9 )</td>', 'This is adorable, I like the way the baby is grasping the adults hand, and the intent look on the baby''s face as if it is listening with a great deal of interest.  The miracle of life always makes me happy and to see it displayed like this is wonderful This is great ( 9 )', '2003-11-15 14:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(486260, 46600, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love it how you captured the emotion on the face in combination with the motion blur of the performance itself. I have my doubts about the color and the border, but the capture of this combination and the composition is good enough to grant it a 10. :)</td>', 'I love it how you captured the emotion on the face in combination with the motion blur of the performance itself. I have my doubts about the color and the border, but the capture of this combination and the composition is good enough to grant it a 10. :)', '2003-11-15 14:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(486261, 46609, 10848, '<td valign="top">I like this, some people I am sure won''t get it but I do, the crystal ball capturing the lighted background is great, and the depth of field is awesome, great job!</td>', 'I like this, some people I am sure won''t get it but I do, the crystal ball capturing the lighted background is great, and the depth of field is awesome, great job!', '2003-11-15 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(486262, 46622, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting appraoch to this shot, I like the way you captured the eye of the needle against the eye, very creative, the darkness adds intrigue to me, I like this shot very creative and great capture</td>', 'This is a very interesting appraoch to this shot, I like the way you captured the eye of the needle against the eye, very creative, the darkness adds intrigue to me, I like this shot very creative and great capture', '2003-11-15 14:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(486263, 46396, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful freeze of motion. The position of the water surface and the iceblock itself makes this a nice composition, the edges of the drop airhole in the water work well as leading lines. I can hear myself think "Plop" when I look at this.<br/>B&amp;W conversion works well here.</td>', 'Wonderful freeze of motion. The position of the water surface and the iceblock itself makes this a nice composition, the edges of the drop airhole in the water work well as leading lines. I can hear myself think "Plop" when I look at this.B&W conversion works well here.', '2003-11-15 14:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
