(486621, 46198, 10275, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but it is very beautiful. The contrast between the black and red makes this very striking photo. Love the abstract shapes. I hope people appreciate your art, cause I sure do. My only suggestion would be to place a small red squarley in the top right corner fo the photo to balance the composition a bit. Still like it very much.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but it is very beautiful. The contrast between the black and red makes this very striking photo. Love the abstract shapes. I hope people appreciate your art, cause I sure do. My only suggestion would be to place a small red squarley in the top right corner fo the photo to balance the composition a bit. Still like it very much.', '2003-11-15 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(486624, 46657, 10275, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo. Good sharpness. Lovely colour. Interesting background. Very well lit. You should have left a tiny bit more breathing space on left and right - it''s a bit too tight. Also it could have been even more striking if more of the reflections on the bottom were included. This should score in amongh the top photos.</td>', 'Really like this photo. Good sharpness. Lovely colour. Interesting background. Very well lit. You should have left a tiny bit more breathing space on left and right - it''s a bit too tight. Also it could have been even more striking if more of the reflections on the bottom were included. This should score in amongh the top photos.', '2003-11-15 23:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(486625, 45802, 10275, '<td valign="top">You are dead on with this. I could have guessed it without your title - it''s so good. It looks so real (I hope it''s not). My only suggesion would be to somehow soften the light striking the gums and tongue to lessen the glare.</td>', 'You are dead on with this. I could have guessed it without your title - it''s so good. It looks so real (I hope it''s not). My only suggesion would be to somehow soften the light striking the gums and tongue to lessen the glare.', '2003-11-15 23:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(486628, 46174, 10275, '<td valign="top">What a precious portrait. It''s perfect. Well lit, sharp, lovely subject. Her expression makes the photo. Background is good - uncluttered. I just feel it needs a touch of colour somewhere.</td>', 'What a precious portrait. It''s perfect. Well lit, sharp, lovely subject. Her expression makes the photo. Background is good - uncluttered. I just feel it needs a touch of colour somewhere.', '2003-11-15 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(486629, 46050, 10275, '<td valign="top">Superb piece of art. Just beautiful. The prism colours add life to this image. Her expression is nice and soft. My only suggesion would be to add a tiny bit of contrast to the black portions of the image - it kind of looks a bit greysh (but it could be a monitor calibration issue.) Among my top pics.</td>', 'Superb piece of art. Just beautiful. The prism colours add life to this image. Her expression is nice and soft. My only suggesion would be to add a tiny bit of contrast to the black portions of the image - it kind of looks a bit greysh (but it could be a monitor calibration issue.) Among my top pics.', '2003-11-15 23:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(486630, 46644, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very well shot. Love everything about it. The colours, the sharpness, the composition. The background and foreground were carefully chosen. This would have scored well in the still life challenge as well. Here is illustrates the title very well. The only tiny thing is that your border looks like it got chopped off. Still very good image.</td>', 'Very well shot. Love everything about it. The colours, the sharpness, the composition. The background and foreground were carefully chosen. This would have scored well in the still life challenge as well. Here is illustrates the title very well. The only tiny thing is that your border looks like it got chopped off. Still very good image.', '2003-11-15 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(486631, 46396, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white art. Love the "frozen" motion. Composition is good. Very clean and simply well done.</td>', 'Beautiful black and white art. Love the "frozen" motion. Composition is good. Very clean and simply well done.', '2003-11-15 23:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(486632, 46235, 14157, '<td valign="top">You should have put a little more boat into the picture.</td>', 'You should have put a little more boat into the picture.', '2003-11-15 23:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486633, 46447, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favs in this challenge. So well composed. I love the way you splashed a bit of sand on the bottle to make it look like it''s been sitting there for a while. The net adds very nice touch to the whole image as it frames the bottle. My only suggesions would be to rotate the star tiny bit to make it less obvious that it was arranged, and make the border thinner (it should not compete with the fishnet lines). Otherwise beautiful photo.</td>', 'This is one of my favs in this challenge. So well composed. I love the way you splashed a bit of sand on the bottle to make it look like it''s been sitting there for a while. The net adds very nice touch to the whole image as it frames the bottle. My only suggesions would be to rotate the star tiny bit to make it less obvious that it was arranged, and make the border thinner (it should not compete with the fishnet lines). Otherwise beautiful photo.', '2003-11-15 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(486634, 46615, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro. Great backlighting and simple background makes this a very striking photo. My only suggesion woud be the play more with the composition (maybe angle it to follow the leaves'' lines...)</td>', 'Beautiful macro. Great backlighting and simple background makes this a very striking photo. My only suggesion woud be the play more with the composition (maybe angle it to follow the leaves'' lines...)', '2003-11-15 23:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(486635, 46162, 10275, '<td valign="top">I bet this was fun to arrange. Love the whole composition. The simple background and colour scheme, the sharpness,  the llighting, they all make it a very professional looking. Well done.</td>', 'I bet this was fun to arrange. Love the whole composition. The simple background and colour scheme, the sharpness,  the llighting, they all make it a very professional looking. Well done.', '2003-11-15 23:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486636, 46429, 14157, '<td valign="top">Cool Effect.</td>', 'Cool Effect.', '2003-11-15 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486638, 46369, 10275, '<td valign="top">This cat shot is well done. Love the way the cat tilted her head. Her eyes are like two liquid beads. The blue eyes nicely contrasts with the pinkish background. I like the way the parts that are supposed to be sharp are sharp and the rest is nicely soft. My only suggestion would be not to cut her top ear off (I mean in the photo of course). Lovely companion you have.</td>', 'This cat shot is well done. Love the way the cat tilted her head. Her eyes are like two liquid beads. The blue eyes nicely contrasts with the pinkish background. I like the way the parts that are supposed to be sharp are sharp and the rest is nicely soft. My only suggestion would be not to cut her top ear off (I mean in the photo of course). Lovely companion you have.', '2003-11-15 23:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(486640, 46320, 13381, '<td valign="top">This is really a stunning shot.  The short depth of field is crucial to making this picture come out well, and that brilliant green eye is amazing.  I can''t think of any constructive criticism to give you, so I think I''ll stick to admiration!</td>', 'This is really a stunning shot.  The short depth of field is crucial to making this picture come out well, and that brilliant green eye is amazing.  I can''t think of any constructive criticism to give you, so I think I''ll stick to admiration!', '2003-11-15 23:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(486643, 45822, 14157, '<td valign="top">You should have put an unpaved road. It would have been more true to the title.</td>', 'You should have put an unpaved road. It would have been more true to the title.', '2003-11-16 00:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(486644, 46655, 10275, '<td valign="top">The variety of the sea gifts makes this an interesting photo. The colours are nice and soft - realistically looking. You have some lovely textures. It needs tiny bit of sharpening, but my biggest suggestion is to really stay away from thick brown borders. This border totally kills your beautiful shot.  I am not taking any points off for it, but IMO it doesn''t add or help your image, it distracts from it. Perhaps thinner cream-coloured border would have been a better choice.</td>', 'The variety of the sea gifts makes this an interesting photo. The colours are nice and soft - realistically looking. You have some lovely textures. It needs tiny bit of sharpening, but my biggest suggestion is to really stay away from thick brown borders. This border totally kills your beautiful shot.  I am not taking any points off for it, but IMO it doesn''t add or help your image, it distracts from it. Perhaps thinner cream-coloured border would have been a better choice.', '2003-11-16 00:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(486645, 46652, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. Great simple colours. Sharpness is amazing and the composition is dead on. I love the soft appearance of the sand on the left side - it ads feeling of time to this photo. So very well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. Great simple colours. Sharpness is amazing and the composition is dead on. I love the soft appearance of the sand on the left side - it ads feeling of time to this photo. So very well done.', '2003-11-16 00:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486646, 46652, 13381, '<td valign="top">I wish I had beautiful lighthouse landscapes to photograph! You''ve done a lovely job with this one.  The composition of the frame is nice, and the smooth sand makes an inviting landscape.</td>', 'I wish I had beautiful lighthouse landscapes to photograph! You''ve done a lovely job with this one.  The composition of the frame is nice, and the smooth sand makes an inviting landscape.', '2003-11-16 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(486647, 46563, 10275, '<td valign="top">Love this image. It has golden peaceful feeling. Good sharpness and composition. But please stay away from those dreadful black overpowering borders. A border half the size would have been much more tasteful. This is an overkill. No points taken off for this as the photo itself it very nice.</td>', 'Love this image. It has golden peaceful feeling. Good sharpness and composition. But please stay away from those dreadful black overpowering borders. A border half the size would have been much more tasteful. This is an overkill. No points taken off for this as the photo itself it very nice.', '2003-11-16 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486649, 46675, 13381, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I like this unusual perspective, cropped much tighter than the traditional rose photo.  The curves and colors are very sensual.  On one hand, I''d like to see the depth of field a bit greater, so I can see more than one petal in crisp focus, but on the other hand, I like how it sort of melts away into the background.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow.  I like this unusual perspective, cropped much tighter than the traditional rose photo.  The curves and colors are very sensual.  On one hand, I''d like to see the depth of field a bit greater, so I can see more than one petal in crisp focus, but on the other hand, I like how it sort of melts away into the background.  Nice job!', '2003-11-16 00:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(486650, 46320, 10275, '<td valign="top">A guide to dead birds? (just kidding :-))  This photo is very well done. Love the shallow depth of filed as it brings emphasis to the bird. The sharpness and detail are amazing. The colours are great - the orange beak with the blue water behind it. The composition is good too. Love the way it curves. This indeed would be a great shot for a book cover.</td>', 'A guide to dead birds? (just kidding :-))  This photo is very well done. Love the shallow depth of filed as it brings emphasis to the bird. The sharpness and detail are amazing. The colours are great - the orange beak with the blue water behind it. The composition is good too. Love the way it curves. This indeed would be a great shot for a book cover.', '2003-11-16 00:11:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(486652, 46356, 10275, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many of us are actually counting the steps :-))<br/>I love the abstract look of this photo, the cool simple colours, and the crisp sharpness. I like the way half of the photo is in the sun and half is in shadow. I would have played with the composition a bit more. But otherwise good shot.</td>', 'I wonder how many of us are actually counting the steps :-))I love the abstract look of this photo, the cool simple colours, and the crisp sharpness. I like the way half of the photo is in the sun and half is in shadow. I would have played with the composition a bit more. But otherwise good shot.', '2003-11-16 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(486655, 46397, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good shot of an eclipse. However it lacks sharpness. Did you use digital zoom? It looks a bit pixelated. Also composition-wise it is dead center which makes this a bit unatractive. Also, you could consider turning it into black and white more dramatic photo, loosing the greenish cast.</td>', 'Good shot of an eclipse. However it lacks sharpness. Did you use digital zoom? It looks a bit pixelated. Also composition-wise it is dead center which makes this a bit unatractive. Also, you could consider turning it into black and white more dramatic photo, loosing the greenish cast.', '2003-11-16 00:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486657, 45870, 10275, '<td valign="top">What a superb catch. Lovely colours and shaprness. No visible barrel distortion. Great texture. Simple and fun. Black border would have been probably better, but no points taken for that. Love your photo.</td>', 'What a superb catch. Lovely colours and shaprness. No visible barrel distortion. Great texture. Simple and fun. Black border would have been probably better, but no points taken for that. Love your photo.', '2003-11-16 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(486659, 46460, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Good choice of sepia toning on this.  Sorry, but I wouldn\''t change a thing on this. Well done.</td>', 'Great photo. Good choice of sepia toning on this.  Sorry, but I wouldn\''t change a thing on this. Well done.', '2003-11-16 00:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(486660, 46302, 13381, '<td valign="top">The picture is stunning, but I find the frame distracting.</td>', 'The picture is stunning, but I find the frame distracting.', '2003-11-16 00:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486661, 46575, 13722, '<td valign="top">I like this view of the bridge instead of a straight down the middle shot.</td>', 'I like this view of the bridge instead of a straight down the middle shot.', '2003-11-16 00:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(486663, 46676, 10275, '<td valign="top">This photo really expresses the joy. I can see my kid joining yours in the fun. Love the way you captured the chocolate dripping of the spoon onto her/his clothes. It is very spontanious shot. The only distracting bit is the bottom glare on the pot and the harsh shadow the figure casts. Have you considered using no flash and just sticking to normal lighting of the room with longer exposure to compensate.</td>', 'This photo really expresses the joy. I can see my kid joining yours in the fun. Love the way you captured the chocolate dripping of the spoon onto her/his clothes. It is very spontanious shot. The only distracting bit is the bottom glare on the pot and the harsh shadow the figure casts. Have you considered using no flash and just sticking to normal lighting of the room with longer exposure to compensate.', '2003-11-16 00:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(486665, 46670, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely interpretation of this book. Love the mottled background that totally fits with the image. The shallow DOF is great in this shot. Sharpness is good. In terms of composition, I think it either needs to be centered or more off-center. The way it is now, it is kind of in between which makes it a bit less powerful. Othewise great photo.</td>', 'Lovely interpretation of this book. Love the mottled background that totally fits with the image. The shallow DOF is great in this shot. Sharpness is good. In terms of composition, I think it either needs to be centered or more off-center. The way it is now, it is kind of in between which makes it a bit less powerful. Othewise great photo.', '2003-11-16 00:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(486667, 46600, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very beautiful photo. I love the feeling of movement in your shot. The warm golden colours add to the almost romantic feel of the whole image. Too bad you coudn''t edit out the speck in the middle of blackness and the spot above her head (not your fault, I hate the rules too). I do not like the border as IMO it breaks the feeling of movement and makes it squared off. If you insist on border, maybe just a simple thin white one would have been better. Otherwise really nice image.</td>', 'This is very beautiful photo. I love the feeling of movement in your shot. The warm golden colours add to the almost romantic feel of the whole image. Too bad you coudn''t edit out the speck in the middle of blackness and the spot above her head (not your fault, I hate the rules too). I do not like the border as IMO it breaks the feeling of movement and makes it squared off. If you insist on border, maybe just a simple thin white one would have been better. Otherwise really nice image.', '2003-11-16 00:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(486668, 46578, 10275, '<td valign="top">Cute hamster, but I don''t think hamsters are very wild, as they are bread in captivity. The sharpness of your photo is good, but it would have been better if the hamster were in focus and the rest of the cage were a bit softer. Also, the text label just beside the hamsters head is a bit distracting to the overall fun look. I think if you had zoomed in on the hamster a bit more and made this into a vertical format cutting out a bit of the clutter around him, it would have made it into more wilder look that you were after. Otherwise not bad shot.</td>', 'Cute hamster, but I don''t think hamsters are very wild, as they are bread in captivity. The sharpness of your photo is good, but it would have been better if the hamster were in focus and the rest of the cage were a bit softer. Also, the text label just beside the hamsters head is a bit distracting to the overall fun look. I think if you had zoomed in on the hamster a bit more and made this into a vertical format cutting out a bit of the clutter around him, it would have made it into more wilder look that you were after. Otherwise not bad shot.', '2003-11-16 00:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(486673, 46248, 10275, '<td valign="top">You puppy is very adorable. I have a bit of experience photographing tiny dogs, as I have 3 small chihuahuas of my own. It''s not easy to photograph them as they are in constant movement. <br/> <br/>Your photo has good sharpness, but it could use a bit of brightening as your puppy is fairly dark on a fairly greyish background. I don''t think the desaturation of other colours was a good choice. The purple leash in front of the pup distracts from the dog himself. Also your hand was not neccessary in the shot, as the buckle size on the leash already establishes that the dog is small. The green gras could have liven up the photo and make nice colour contrast to the dog. 7<br/> <br/>Photographing young dogs needs lots of patience and hundreds of shots to get just the right one. So don''t give up. You will eventually end up with some very good shots of your little companion if you keep trying.</td>', 'You puppy is very adorable. I have a bit of experience photographing tiny dogs, as I have 3 small chihuahuas of my own. It''s not easy to photograph them as they are in constant movement.  Your photo has good sharpness, but it could use a bit of brightening as your puppy is fairly dark on a fairly greyish background. I don''t think the desaturation of other colours was a good choice. The purple leash in front of the pup distracts from the dog himself. Also your hand was not neccessary in the shot, as the buckle size on the leash already establishes that the dog is small. The green gras could have liven up the photo and make nice colour contrast to the dog. 7 Photographing young dogs needs lots of patience and hundreds of shots to get just the right one. So don''t give up. You will eventually end up with some very good shots of your little companion if you keep trying.', '2003-11-16 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(486675, 46648, 10275, '<td valign="top">I am sorry, but I just have to take a shot at this one. You didn''t have to include the book in the photo. Viewers are not dum, they would get the message.  There are few things you could avoid in your photo. One is the red eyes of the subject. If you bounce your flash of the ceiling or disable the flash and use room lighting to light your model you will end up with more naturally looking eyes and face. Second, do not center your subject like you''ve done here. Try different positions and viewpoints. He looks very tense and his face is very red. Also closing his mouth a bit could have avoided showing his badly yellow teeth (sorry). Third, why is he naked? Do guys usually date with no cloth on? Just doesn''t make sense in this case. Also, cropping the photo differently to give the person more space around him could have improved it tiny bit. Don''t get me wrong, I uderstand you probably shot this as a joke, but even a joke photo can be done with taste.</td>', 'I am sorry, but I just have to take a shot at this one. You didn''t have to include the book in the photo. Viewers are not dum, they would get the message.  There are few things you could avoid in your photo. One is the red eyes of the subject. If you bounce your flash of the ceiling or disable the flash and use room lighting to light your model you will end up with more naturally looking eyes and face. Second, do not center your subject like you''ve done here. Try different positions and viewpoints. He looks very tense and his face is very red. Also closing his mouth a bit could have avoided showing his badly yellow teeth (sorry). Third, why is he naked? Do guys usually date with no cloth on? Just doesn''t make sense in this case. Also, cropping the photo differently to give the person more space around him could have improved it tiny bit. Don''t get me wrong, I uderstand you probably shot this as a joke, but even a joke photo can be done with taste.', '2003-11-16 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486677, 46171, 10275, '<td valign="top">Undoubtedly shot by a man...  <br/> <br/>Funny idea, but the photo itself is kind of boring to look at. Perhaps closer zoom and crop could have improved it a bit. It looks like the camera had hard time focusing on the cover. Some postprocessing would improve the colours of the photo.</td>', 'Undoubtedly shot by a man...   Funny idea, but the photo itself is kind of boring to look at. Perhaps closer zoom and crop could have improved it a bit. It looks like the camera had hard time focusing on the cover. Some postprocessing would improve the colours of the photo.', '2003-11-16 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(486679, 46357, 10275, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you were trying to do in this image. It has lovely red colour, but beyond that, it looks like accidentally pressed shutter. Also, using a flash when you take a macro like this is not advisable to avoid glares. Better use natural or other kind of lighting source.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you were trying to do in this image. It has lovely red colour, but beyond that, it looks like accidentally pressed shutter. Also, using a flash when you take a macro like this is not advisable to avoid glares. Better use natural or other kind of lighting source.', '2003-11-16 01:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(486682, 46451, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting play of light and shadow. Very neat idea indeed. However, the composition of your photo could use some improvement. Either rotate the book so it is diagonal and more interesting, or center it and show both pages equally as an open book symbolism. Simple black background you are using is good. You were probably trying to focus on the angels, so the forefront of your photo is a bit blurry and distracts from the rest of the photo. Not a bad photo.</td>', 'Interesting play of light and shadow. Very neat idea indeed. However, the composition of your photo could use some improvement. Either rotate the book so it is diagonal and more interesting, or center it and show both pages equally as an open book symbolism. Simple black background you are using is good. You were probably trying to focus on the angels, so the forefront of your photo is a bit blurry and distracts from the rest of the photo. Not a bad photo.', '2003-11-16 01:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(486683, 46673, 10275, '<td valign="top">If you painted this with a lit flame then it is very neat. I can''t see any digital noise, so it is quite well done.</td>', 'If you painted this with a lit flame then it is very neat. I can''t see any digital noise, so it is quite well done.', '2003-11-16 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(486684, 46004, 10275, '<td valign="top">I think you misunderstood the challenge itself. You were not supposed to take a shot of a book title text, but set up a photo to represent a book title. If this was done as a joke, than ignore my comment above. Good use of shalow depth of field. I don''t like the way you cropped it - it is too tight on the right. Focusing is also a bit off on the right side. The background fits the subject well.</td>', 'I think you misunderstood the challenge itself. You were not supposed to take a shot of a book title text, but set up a photo to represent a book title. If this was done as a joke, than ignore my comment above. Good use of shalow depth of field. I don''t like the way you cropped it - it is too tight on the right. Focusing is also a bit off on the right side. The background fits the subject well.', '2003-11-16 01:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(486685, 46390, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I probably would have cropped more of the water out</td>', 'Nice picture, but I probably would have cropped more of the water out', '2003-11-16 01:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(486699, 46104, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting, good concept, great lighting and interesting charecterization of a ying yang, I like it (8)</td>', 'This is very interesting, good concept, great lighting and interesting charecterization of a ying yang, I like it (8)', '2003-11-16 03:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(486701, 46644, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, beautifully set up and the lighting is great, the contrast is wonderful also, the colors are great I like it alot! Great job, and good luck</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, beautifully set up and the lighting is great, the contrast is wonderful also, the colors are great I like it alot! Great job, and good luck', '2003-11-16 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(486703, 45793, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot, perfectly done in my opinion, the lighting adds the rianbow colors of the metal in this I like this a great shot, and good luck!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot, perfectly done in my opinion, the lighting adds the rianbow colors of the metal in this I like this a great shot, and good luck!', '2003-11-16 04:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(486704, 46640, 14227, '<td valign="top">Celtic crosses meant alot to my uncle, they mean alot to my husband, and I think they are just beautiful.  Nice work.  I hope to see this very cross, sometime very soon.  Love, Me</td>', 'Celtic crosses meant alot to my uncle, they mean alot to my husband, and I think they are just beautiful.  Nice work.  I hope to see this very cross, sometime very soon.  Love, Me', '2003-11-16 04:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(486705, 46560, 10848, '<td valign="top">This shot is beautiful, well composed, I love the effect you have accomplished here, this is great, good job</td>', 'This shot is beautiful, well composed, I love the effect you have accomplished here, this is great, good job', '2003-11-16 04:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(486706, 46570, 10848, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, I love the way you have captured the mystery here with the man in the shadows. Seems very real! Fits your title perfectly great shot</td>', 'I like this shot, I love the way you have captured the mystery here with the man in the shadows. Seems very real! Fits your title perfectly great shot', '2003-11-16 04:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486707, 46296, 14227, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.', '2003-11-16 04:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(486708, 45926, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot! I love the purple sky effect and the yellow hue of the trees against the purple horizon adds alot to this shot, not boring at all I love it.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot! I love the purple sky effect and the yellow hue of the trees against the purple horizon adds alot to this shot, not boring at all I love it.', '2003-11-16 04:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
