(486756, 46396, 669, '<td valign="top">Not a lot critical to say about this.  Great idea and well executed.  Good luck with a ribbon.</td>', 'Not a lot critical to say about this.  Great idea and well executed.  Good luck with a ribbon.', '2003-11-16 05:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(486757, 46357, 669, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to do, but the white glare is a little sistracting for me.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to do, but the white glare is a little sistracting for me.', '2003-11-16 05:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486758, 46655, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and focus here.  As I''m sure others will say - you somewhat over did the border.  I think a solid colour (white, black) may have looked better.</td>', 'Nice colour and focus here.  As I''m sure others will say - you somewhat over did the border.  I think a solid colour (white, black) may have looked better.', '2003-11-16 05:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(486759, 46549, 669, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Looks a tad unbalanced.  I think the point of focus is a little too far to the left?</td>', 'Great idea.  Looks a tad unbalanced.  I think the point of focus is a little too far to the left?', '2003-11-16 05:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(486760, 46402, 669, '<td valign="top">Fantastic landscape.  Pretty much spot on, but why did you choose that border?  Had you cropped it to a sharp line, I don''t think it would have made a lot of difference visually, but DPC''s ''vote down fancy borders'' police wouldn''t be knocking off marks.</td>', 'Fantastic landscape.  Pretty much spot on, but why did you choose that border?  Had you cropped it to a sharp line, I don''t think it would have made a lot of difference visually, but DPC''s ''vote down fancy borders'' police wouldn''t be knocking off marks.', '2003-11-16 05:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(486761, 46584, 669, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  I think the pic looks a little unbalanced.  I think I''d have tried to move the mouse/cookie more into the middle of the frame?</td>', 'Clever idea.  I think the pic looks a little unbalanced.  I think I''d have tried to move the mouse/cookie more into the middle of the frame?', '2003-11-16 05:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(486762, 46602, 669, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but the image is very obviously ruined by jpegging at too low a quality.  If you look at the sky is looks blocky and pixilated.  I notice the image is only 13kb.  DPC allows you 150kb to play with, so it may be worth creating a larger image to improve quality.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but the image is very obviously ruined by jpegging at too low a quality.  If you look at the sky is looks blocky and pixilated.  I notice the image is only 13kb.  DPC allows you 150kb to play with, so it may be worth creating a larger image to improve quality.', '2003-11-16 05:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486763, 45698, 669, '<td valign="top">I really like the colour and angles in this - just the kind of shot I appreciate.  Not sure if it''s unavoidable (camera maybe), but certain lines look quite jaggedy?</td>', 'I really like the colour and angles in this - just the kind of shot I appreciate.  Not sure if it''s unavoidable (camera maybe), but certain lines look quite jaggedy?', '2003-11-16 05:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486765, 46541, 669, '<td valign="top">I like the colourisation and contrast.  Not sure if composition has the dove a little low in the frame?  It''s not too noticable, but the image looks a little oversharpened?  (Very sharp edge on the dove''s breast, and speckles in the background.)</td>', 'I like the colourisation and contrast.  Not sure if composition has the dove a little low in the frame?  It''s not too noticable, but the image looks a little oversharpened?  (Very sharp edge on the dove''s breast, and speckles in the background.)', '2003-11-16 05:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486766, 46239, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think I''d have tried to get the vane vertical.  Also, it may have been worth running the image through NeatImage (www.neatimage.com), which would probably have made the sky nice and smooth.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think I''d have tried to get the vane vertical.  Also, it may have been worth running the image through NeatImage (www.neatimage.com), which would probably have made the sky nice and smooth.', '2003-11-16 05:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486767, 46613, 669, '<td valign="top">I think this goes beyond what most on DPC would consider a photograph, but I like what you''ve done.  The only thing I''d like is a little more room between the purple border and the Amazon arrow.  It seems too near as it is.</td>', 'I think this goes beyond what most on DPC would consider a photograph, but I like what you''ve done.  The only thing I''d like is a little more room between the purple border and the Amazon arrow.  It seems too near as it is.', '2003-11-16 05:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(486768, 46600, 669, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of movement.  Not quite sure about the colourisation - I think I''d maybe have gone a little lighter?  Also, I''m not keen on the border.  A simple single pixel of colour and then 10px of black would have worked better I think.</td>', 'I like the feeling of movement.  Not quite sure about the colourisation - I think I''d maybe have gone a little lighter?  Also, I''m not keen on the border.  A simple single pixel of colour and then 10px of black would have worked better I think.', '2003-11-16 05:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(486769, 46521, 669, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image.  Very little to critique here really..  Shame there''s a branch on the right, but otherwise pretty spot on.  Fits the title well too.  Good luck on a ribbon.</td>', 'What a stunning image.  Very little to critique here really..  Shame there''s a branch on the right, but otherwise pretty spot on.  Fits the title well too.  Good luck on a ribbon.', '2003-11-16 05:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
