(486826, 46624, 7810, '<td valign="top">Wish i could see more of the flag..shame we can''t control the wind:) nice shot though</td>', 'Wish i could see more of the flag..shame we can''t control the wind:) nice shot though', '2003-11-16 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
