(486868, 46051, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the limited pallet. The focus and lighting are good. I don''t know about the knife pointing to the edge of the chair. I like it as a leading line but think it gives the photo a "too studied" look.</td>', 'I like the limited pallet. The focus and lighting are good. I don''t know about the knife pointing to the edge of the chair. I like it as a leading line but think it gives the photo a "too studied" look.', '2003-11-16 10:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
