(486876, 45926, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this for everything that isn''t there. Very nice and clean. <br/>Back again. I really like the feeling of this. It is so well balanced yet it isn''t boring. Normally that much empty sky would detract from it, but here it adds to the silent feeling.  I will be adding this to my favorites after to challenge.</td>', 'I like this for everything that isn''t there. Very nice and clean. Back again. I really like the feeling of this. It is so well balanced yet it isn''t boring. Normally that much empty sky would detract from it, but here it adds to the silent feeling.  I will be adding this to my favorites after to challenge.', '2003-11-16 10:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
