(487018, 46678, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very abstract but fractally attractive composition.  It would have been nice if somehow you managed to get some blue color (like sky) into that diagonal shadow, to balance out the colors.</td>', 'Very abstract but fractally attractive composition.  It would have been nice if somehow you managed to get some blue color (like sky) into that diagonal shadow, to balance out the colors.', '2003-11-16 14:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487023, 45870, 12151, '<td valign="top">Visually interesting.  However, I must admit I''d be much more impressed with this image if it were a painting or drawing rather than an artistic photo.  As a documentary photo, though, this would be very nice, at is captures a real, uncommon, and beautifully-colored image.</td>', 'Visually interesting.  However, I must admit I''d be much more impressed with this image if it were a painting or drawing rather than an artistic photo.  As a documentary photo, though, this would be very nice, at is captures a real, uncommon, and beautifully-colored image.', '2003-11-16 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487024, 46607, 12151, '<td valign="top">The black &amp; white really adds a spooky effect - well done.</td>', 'The black & white really adds a spooky effect - well done.', '2003-11-16 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(487027, 46664, 12151, '<td valign="top">Simple, but it works.</td>', 'Simple, but it works.', '2003-11-16 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487032, 46664, 6132, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition! One of my personal faves for this challange. You should easily get a ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent composition! One of my personal faves for this challange. You should easily get a ribbon. Good luck!', '2003-11-16 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487036, 46173, 12151, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the book and book title.</td>', 'Good capture of the book and book title.', '2003-11-16 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487043, 45869, 12151, '<td valign="top">I really like the dream-like quality of this photo, although that speck in the upper left is a little distracting.  Still very effective techniques here, nonetheless.  The scores are close for me, but I might as well boost one above the rest; this is my top score for the week.</td>', 'I really like the dream-like quality of this photo, although that speck in the upper left is a little distracting.  Still very effective techniques here, nonetheless.  The scores are close for me, but I might as well boost one above the rest; this is my top score for the week.', '2003-11-16 15:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(487044, 46662, 12151, '<td valign="top">The textures here make such a surreal mood - good job, very unique image of a statue.</td>', 'The textures here make such a surreal mood - good job, very unique image of a statue.', '2003-11-16 15:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(487045, 46002, 12151, '<td valign="top">The mood here is very enticing, with the contrasted colors at night.</td>', 'The mood here is very enticing, with the contrasted colors at night.', '2003-11-16 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
