(487165, 46418, 11295, '<td valign="top">Should have used black and white for this, as it is, it''s just kinda gross. Also, there is too much context, not enough dead bird to be effective.</td>', 'Should have used black and white for this, as it is, it''s just kinda gross. Also, there is too much context, not enough dead bird to be effective.', '2003-11-16 19:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(487170, 46666, 2158, '<td valign="top">A bit difficult to see on a black background.</td>', 'A bit difficult to see on a black background.', '2003-11-16 19:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487199, 46128, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really like the photo. I think its a Broad Wing, but it could be a Redtail. I was going to ask if it was wild or captive, but I think I see telltale signs of fencing in the foreground. Its still really nice. I''ve been trying to get some pics of Redtails this fall, but they are really elusive. Check my profile to see a couple of attempts.</td>', 'Nice shot, really like the photo. I think its a Broad Wing, but it could be a Redtail. I was going to ask if it was wild or captive, but I think I see telltale signs of fencing in the foreground. Its still really nice. I''ve been trying to get some pics of Redtails this fall, but they are really elusive. Check my profile to see a couple of attempts.', '2003-11-16 20:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(487200, 46312, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The Colonel in the photo looks like he has alot of character. I''m an Army brat and a retired Marine so your photo was special for me.</td>', 'Great composition. The Colonel in the photo looks like he has alot of character. I''m an Army brat and a retired Marine so your photo was special for me.', '2003-11-16 20:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487203, 46670, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I thought of this title, but didn''t think I could do the photo that well. Good contrasting background. I might have tried a little closer crop to see if I could get more detail on the sword, but its still well done.</td>', 'Great photo. I thought of this title, but didn''t think I could do the photo that well. Good contrasting background. I might have tried a little closer crop to see if I could get more detail on the sword, but its still well done.', '2003-11-16 20:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(487226, 46277, 13282, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Could improve by avoiding the glare at the top right corner.</td>', 'Neat idea. Could improve by avoiding the glare at the top right corner.', '2003-11-16 20:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(487227, 46204, 13282, '<td valign="top">This does look mysterious...a place I would like to explore.  Nice photo.</td>', 'This does look mysterious...a place I would like to explore.  Nice photo.', '2003-11-16 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(487230, 46229, 13282, '<td valign="top">The colour of the water in this photo is pretty amazing.  Unfortunately it stands out more so than the willow tree, which I believe you intended to be the focal point.  It''s a beautiful shot though.</td>', 'The colour of the water in this photo is pretty amazing.  Unfortunately it stands out more so than the willow tree, which I believe you intended to be the focal point.  It''s a beautiful shot though.', '2003-11-16 20:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(487232, 46447, 13282, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I like it.</td>', 'Nice job!  I like it.', '2003-11-16 21:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(487235, 46477, 13282, '<td valign="top">I like the irony in this.  Neat shot too.</td>', 'I like the irony in this.  Neat shot too.', '2003-11-16 21:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487237, 46401, 13282, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  It''s so clear.  I like how the bridge is far enough to the side, so that it doesn''t dominate the picture but adds to it.</td>', 'Beautiful.  It''s so clear.  I like how the bridge is far enough to the side, so that it doesn''t dominate the picture but adds to it.', '2003-11-16 21:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487238, 45943, 13282, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and suits the title perfectly.</td>', 'Very nice, and suits the title perfectly.', '2003-11-16 21:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(487242, 46642, 13282, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  It captures the title superbly. The focal point is clear, and the slightly out of focus perfume bottles frame it perfectly.</td>', 'Great photo.  It captures the title superbly. The focal point is clear, and the slightly out of focus perfume bottles frame it perfectly.', '2003-11-16 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(487245, 46523, 13282, '<td valign="top">Blurry, but perhaps that was intentional.</td>', 'Blurry, but perhaps that was intentional.', '2003-11-16 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487246, 46128, 13282, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the hawk.  You almost got the fence out of the picture, good try with that.</td>', 'Nice shot of the hawk.  You almost got the fence out of the picture, good try with that.', '2003-11-16 21:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487247, 45891, 13282, '<td valign="top">The frog is a gorgeous colour.  You have good detail of it in the shot.  Perhaps a different background could have made the photo and the frogs colouring even more vibrant.</td>', 'The frog is a gorgeous colour.  You have good detail of it in the shot.  Perhaps a different background could have made the photo and the frogs colouring even more vibrant.', '2003-11-16 21:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(487251, 46452, 13282, '<td valign="top">Wow. Way to capture the rider through the air.  Looks great.</td>', 'Wow. Way to capture the rider through the air.  Looks great.', '2003-11-16 21:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(487256, 46596, 13282, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I''m sure Shel Silverstein would get a kick out of where this sidewalk ended.  It seems to be a bit blurry, but I like it.</td>', 'Cute.  I''m sure Shel Silverstein would get a kick out of where this sidewalk ended.  It seems to be a bit blurry, but I like it.', '2003-11-16 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(487259, 46483, 13282, '<td valign="top">This shot has a real glow to it.  The idea definitely comes across.</td>', 'This shot has a real glow to it.  The idea definitely comes across.', '2003-11-16 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(487265, 46616, 10763, '<td valign="top">Awesome Man!!but what''s the on ur finger?lol</td>', 'Awesome Man!!but what''s the on ur finger?lol', '2003-11-16 21:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(487313, 46131, 7800, '<td valign="top">LOL. Wonderful. 10.</td>', 'LOL. Wonderful. 10.', '2003-11-16 22:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(487329, 46418, 10978, '<td valign="top">WOW...I just have to ask why you would put this on here? It is not even a good shot. That is really very sad....I could say ALOT more, but i will stop. 1</td>', 'WOW...I just have to ask why you would put this on here? It is not even a good shot. That is really very sad....I could say ALOT more, but i will stop. 1', '2003-11-16 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(487355, 46396, 14035, '<td valign="top">Lovely. So crisp and clear  - a perfect balance of black and white tones. Oddly enough, I especially like the small opaque bubble in the top left. Beautiful. -10</td>', 'Lovely. So crisp and clear  - a perfect balance of black and white tones. Oddly enough, I especially like the small opaque bubble in the top left. Beautiful. -10', '2003-11-16 23:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(487359, 46363, 14035, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. Beautiful clear tones. I expect it''s the ripple but the gradient looks a llittle rough and is mildly distracting. Good job on the lighting - I''d like to know how you lit this shot and positioned your camera to take it. -9</td>', 'Gorgeous image. Beautiful clear tones. I expect it''s the ripple but the gradient looks a llittle rough and is mildly distracting. Good job on the lighting - I''d like to know how you lit this shot and positioned your camera to take it. -9', '2003-11-16 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(487362, 46680, 14035, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph. It''s abstract and, indeed, very "modern" in appeal. I love the level of sharp and contrast you chose. Beautiful. -9</td>', 'I love this photograph. It''s abstract and, indeed, very "modern" in appeal. I love the level of sharp and contrast you chose. Beautiful. -9', '2003-11-16 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487368, 46563, 14035, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition. The long field with the very sharp front is beautiful and draws your eye into the photograph . The all white sky is a little disconcerting at first but the more I look at it the more I like it. Did you have to do a lot of color adjustment, I wonder. -9</td>', 'Stunning composition. The long field with the very sharp front is beautiful and draws your eye into the photograph . The all white sky is a little disconcerting at first but the more I look at it the more I like it. Did you have to do a lot of color adjustment, I wonder. -9', '2003-11-16 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(487376, 45869, 14035, '<td valign="top">Even though the moon looks like an ad for Chrysler (smile) I think this is simply wonderful. You have captured perfectly the floaty motion of chute falling. Beautiful contrast and blur treatment. If you''d had a round moon, I''d have called this a  ten and a half. -9</td>', 'Even though the moon looks like an ad for Chrysler (smile) I think this is simply wonderful. You have captured perfectly the floaty motion of chute falling. Beautiful contrast and blur treatment. If you''d had a round moon, I''d have called this a  ten and a half. -9', '2003-11-16 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(487404, 46025, 6870, '<td valign="top">Just get a Mac and you''ll never have to repair it. Just kidding! Nice idea and composition. Point of view may be a little far away, but good work.</td>', 'Just get a Mac and you''ll never have to repair it. Just kidding! Nice idea and composition. Point of view may be a little far away, but good work.', '2003-11-16 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(487620, 46676, 13403, '<td valign="top">haha great ;)</td>', 'haha great ;)', '2003-11-17 02:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(487623, 46418, 13403, '<td valign="top">i bet people  hate this.   i think its hilarious :)     congrats on a well earned 10 ;)</td>', 'i bet people  hate this.   i think its hilarious :)     congrats on a well earned 10 ;)', '2003-11-17 03:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487627, 46664, 13403, '<td valign="top">wow, great idea.   heh, smoky- nice touch.   very crisp- i gave you a 10.   i have to guarantee this will be in the top 3.  If not, i quit this site and burn my computer.  (that was an empty threat.. i would never burn my computer)</td>', 'wow, great idea.   heh, smoky- nice touch.   very crisp- i gave you a 10.   i have to guarantee this will be in the top 3.  If not, i quit this site and burn my computer.  (that was an empty threat.. i would never burn my computer)', '2003-11-17 03:04:27.000000', NULL, 1);
