(488193, 46404, 4493, '<td valign="top">How would you like a bump? say from an 8 to, oh I don''t know... 9? At first vote this image didn''t do much for me, but as I look longer at it, I find it to be very good. Your presentation and lighting are very strong on this image. 9 -danny</td>', 'How would you like a bump? say from an 8 to, oh I don''t know... 9? At first vote this image didn''t do much for me, but as I look longer at it, I find it to be very good. Your presentation and lighting are very strong on this image. 9 -danny', '2003-11-17 14:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
