(488296, 46629, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I really get the connection to the title except for the blossom part but the shot is much to noisy and out of focus, the cropping needs to be more angled, so maybe the corners of the book run from one side to the other, half book/half background.  The light is also over exposed on the center of the book.  This is a great idea, just needs some fine tuning. :) A 2</td>', 'Not sure I really get the connection to the title except for the blossom part but the shot is much to noisy and out of focus, the cropping needs to be more angled, so maybe the corners of the book run from one side to the other, half book/half background.  The light is also over exposed on the center of the book.  This is a great idea, just needs some fine tuning. :) A 2', '2003-11-17 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
