(488463, 45793, 9810, '<td valign="top">I dont envision change when I think of that book, more like cameras and what not. Its a nice picture, but the bottem looks out of focus.</td>', 'I dont envision change when I think of that book, more like cameras and what not. Its a nice picture, but the bottem looks out of focus.', '2003-11-17 20:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(488464, 46352, 9810, '<td valign="top">Nice, I liked the way the light is positioned and how the shadows fall.</td>', 'Nice, I liked the way the light is positioned and how the shadows fall.', '2003-11-17 20:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(488466, 46660, 9810, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, to bad those reflections of light are in there, it would habe been alot better if they wernt.</td>', 'Nice picture, to bad those reflections of light are in there, it would habe been alot better if they wernt.', '2003-11-17 20:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(488470, 46390, 9810, '<td valign="top">Not a heck of alot of purple in the photo but its a good one none the less. The name and the boat look oversharpened.</td>', 'Not a heck of alot of purple in the photo but its a good one none the less. The name and the boat look oversharpened.', '2003-11-17 20:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(488472, 46248, 9810, '<td valign="top">my lord thats a small dog, wow.</td>', 'my lord thats a small dog, wow.', '2003-11-17 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(488473, 46429, 8125, '<td valign="top">I think you had a great idea for the challenge.  Technically, the shot seems out of focus and I would suggest a different background.</td>', 'I think you had a great idea for the challenge.  Technically, the shot seems out of focus and I would suggest a different background.', '2003-11-17 20:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(488474, 46195, 9810, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the green on the black background almost makes it glow.</td>', 'Nice picture, the green on the black background almost makes it glow.', '2003-11-17 20:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(488492, 46450, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there!  :-)<br/> <br/>This is a very nice shot of Montezuma''s Castle - but I would prefer it without the book in the foreground.  I would probably have cropped out most of the rocks and left the focus on the Indian ruins.  Great idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been there!  :-) This is a very nice shot of Montezuma''s Castle - but I would prefer it without the book in the foreground.  I would probably have cropped out most of the rocks and left the focus on the Indian ruins.  Great idea for the challenge.', '2003-11-17 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(488493, 46483, 8125, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2003-11-17 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(488496, 45819, 8125, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea for the challenge and an excellent subject.  I like the perspective for this shot.  My only suggestion might have been to center on the front of the car and get the whole thing instead of cutting out a bit on the bottom and sides.</td>', 'Awesome idea for the challenge and an excellent subject.  I like the perspective for this shot.  My only suggestion might have been to center on the front of the car and get the whole thing instead of cutting out a bit on the bottom and sides.', '2003-11-17 21:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(488500, 46104, 8125, '<td valign="top">Good idea, good subject, good background.  <br/> <br/>I wonder how it would have looked to straighten Ying and Yang, and crop it a little tighter.<br/></td>', 'Good idea, good subject, good background.   I wonder how it would have looked to straighten Ying and Yang, and crop it a little tighter.', '2003-11-17 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(488503, 46220, 8125, '<td valign="top">A terrific shot of a beautiful creature.  Well done...</td>', 'A terrific shot of a beautiful creature.  Well done...', '2003-11-17 21:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(488506, 46131, 8125, '<td valign="top">lol - what a great picture.  Well done.  I like your composition and lighting.</td>', 'lol - what a great picture.  Well done.  I like your composition and lighting.', '2003-11-17 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(488520, 46162, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - excellent!  I''d love to know how this was done!!!  I like the frame, composition, lighting.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow - excellent!  I''d love to know how this was done!!!  I like the frame, composition, lighting.  Nice job!', '2003-11-17 21:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(488524, 46025, 8125, '<td valign="top">This book is on my wish list... but I''ll probably wait until the next rev. comes out.  My only suggestion would be a tighter crop, the image seems a bit ''cluttered'' with distraction.  Otherwise, nicely done...</td>', 'This book is on my wish list... but I''ll probably wait until the next rev. comes out.  My only suggestion would be a tighter crop, the image seems a bit ''cluttered'' with distraction.  Otherwise, nicely done...', '2003-11-17 21:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(488539, 46021, 9168, '<td valign="top">I think it might have had more impact if the cards were whiter.</td>', 'I think it might have had more impact if the cards were whiter.', '2003-11-17 21:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(488621, 46058, 14089, '<td valign="top">Great concept, although I would have loved to see a better background. This photo made me laugh out loud...overall I give it 9 for the emotions it inflicted.</td>', 'Great concept, although I would have loved to see a better background. This photo made me laugh out loud...overall I give it 9 for the emotions it inflicted.', '2003-11-18 01:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(488622, 46002, 14089, '<td valign="top">What did you use to make the star effect?</td>', 'What did you use to make the star effect?', '2003-11-18 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(488626, 46538, 14089, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, this photo would look nice in Sepia Tone.</td>', 'Nice composition, this photo would look nice in Sepia Tone.', '2003-11-18 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(488628, 46226, 14089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of Macro, does this make anyone else want to go to a farmer''s market?</td>', 'Beautiful use of Macro, does this make anyone else want to go to a farmer''s market?', '2003-11-18 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(488629, 46388, 14089, '<td valign="top">what is this and how did you make it?</td>', 'what is this and how did you make it?', '2003-11-18 01:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(488632, 46667, 14089, '<td valign="top">Nice display of perspective lines. I say 8.</td>', 'Nice display of perspective lines. I say 8.', '2003-11-18 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(488633, 46428, 14089, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2003-11-18 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(488634, 45822, 14089, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, nice angle.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, nice angle.', '2003-11-18 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488635, 46198, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice.... I like this one... Feels like spinning around when the surroundings cease almost to exist. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice.... I like this one... Feels like spinning around when the surroundings cease almost to exist. Well done!', '2003-11-18 02:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(488636, 46488, 14089, '<td valign="top">This picture screams late 80''s early 90''s to me. Interesting approach to an odd subject.</td>', 'This picture screams late 80''s early 90''s to me. Interesting approach to an odd subject.', '2003-11-18 02:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(488637, 46446, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice looking rose. Good depth of field, subject pleasant contrasting with the background. 9</td>', 'Nice looking rose. Good depth of field, subject pleasant contrasting with the background. 9', '2003-11-18 02:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(488638, 46601, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice looking. Simple. Beauty is simple. Looks like a 9 to me.</td>', 'Nice looking. Simple. Beauty is simple. Looks like a 9 to me.', '2003-11-18 02:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(488639, 46492, 14089, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seend the roses in less focus, but overall nice job.</td>', 'Would have liked to have seend the roses in less focus, but overall nice job.', '2003-11-18 02:12:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(488640, 46592, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful cat. Perfect shot. Crisp and clear. The set-up is nice too. Deserves a ten.</td>', 'Wonderful cat. Perfect shot. Crisp and clear. The set-up is nice too. Deserves a ten.', '2003-11-18 02:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(488641, 46638, 14089, '<td valign="top">Very Punny...did you mean for the ''10'' on the bottle to be your focal point? Nice use of subliminal messaging!</td>', 'Very Punny...did you mean for the ''10'' on the bottle to be your focal point? Nice use of subliminal messaging!', '2003-11-18 02:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(488642, 46657, 14089, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of colors and very nice composition, I''ll say 10.</td>', 'Excellent use of colors and very nice composition, I''ll say 10.', '2003-11-18 02:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(488643, 46404, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great composition and great idea. 10</td>', 'Very nice. Great composition and great idea. 10', '2003-11-18 02:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(488644, 46179, 12902, '<td valign="top">Good looking cat. The picture is not bad either. 8</td>', 'Good looking cat. The picture is not bad either. 8', '2003-11-18 02:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(488645, 46564, 14089, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space on this one, why is the needle bent on the edge?</td>', 'I like the negative space on this one, why is the needle bent on the edge?', '2003-11-18 02:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(488647, 46592, 14089, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lines and contrast.  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Excellent use of lines and contrast.  Good composition as well.', '2003-11-18 02:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(488649, 46417, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. I just love the reflections. The water is mesmerising. I can hear it saying to me: "This is a 10 picture....this is a 10 picture...." 10....</td>', 'Very good photo. I just love the reflections. The water is mesmerising. I can hear it saying to me: "This is a 10 picture....this is a 10 picture...." 10....', '2003-11-18 02:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(488650, 46652, 14089, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful lighthouse. I enjoy the perspective of the walkway to the lighthouse, as well as the detail of the guard rail on the top. This photo flows nicely to me starting with the red at the top, and moving first down, and then to the left with the walkway. Good Job, I say 10.</td>', 'What a beautiful lighthouse. I enjoy the perspective of the walkway to the lighthouse, as well as the detail of the guard rail on the top. This photo flows nicely to me starting with the red at the top, and moving first down, and then to the left with the walkway. Good Job, I say 10.', '2003-11-18 02:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488651, 46173, 14089, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrayal of feelings and emotion. 10.</td>', 'Excellent portrayal of feelings and emotion. 10.', '2003-11-18 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(488652, 46051, 12902, '<td valign="top">I left this one behind because I didn''t know what I was looking at. I was seeing it as an office lamp but the upper part was looking not like a bulb but like a hole in the wall. Today I said: I have to rate it either I see it or not. And I tried again. I can''t tell you how happy I was when I discovered it was a chair. Nice depth of field and nice lighting. Now I can rate it. Looks like a 9 I think.</td>', 'I left this one behind because I didn''t know what I was looking at. I was seeing it as an office lamp but the upper part was looking not like a bulb but like a hole in the wall. Today I said: I have to rate it either I see it or not. And I tried again. I can''t tell you how happy I was when I discovered it was a chair. Nice depth of field and nice lighting. Now I can rate it. Looks like a 9 I think.', '2003-11-18 02:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(488653, 46002, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking one. Comment is useless. 10</td>', 'Very nice looking one. Comment is useless. 10', '2003-11-18 02:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(488655, 45891, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, nice model. I wish I had such a model at home. My only complain: why did you chopped up the finger? I still like it so I will give it a 10.</td>', 'Nice photo, nice model. I wish I had such a model at home. My only complain: why did you chopped up the finger? I still like it so I will give it a 10.', '2003-11-18 02:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(488657, 46631, 12902, '<td valign="top">The lighting is wonderful. I never get my lighting right. I keep looking and looking at this one but it has to end as I still have some pictures to rate. I know anyway that I''ll be looking at it for the whole next week. I hope I will. 10</td>', 'The lighting is wonderful. I never get my lighting right. I keep looking and looking at this one but it has to end as I still have some pictures to rate. I know anyway that I''ll be looking at it for the whole next week. I hope I will. 10', '2003-11-18 02:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(488658, 46204, 12902, '<td valign="top">They should forbid people like you to take pictures. A few more like you out there and all the rest of the photographers will be useless. Dreamlike landscape. 10</td>', 'They should forbid people like you to take pictures. A few more like you out there and all the rest of the photographers will be useless. Dreamlike landscape. 10', '2003-11-18 02:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(488660, 46541, 12902, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dove. I love the warm light you have captured. Is it a sunset? Good DOF. I wish you cropped it a bit from the left as for a better use of rule of thirds but is still a very nice picture. 9</td>', 'Beautiful dove. I love the warm light you have captured. Is it a sunset? Good DOF. I wish you cropped it a bit from the left as for a better use of rule of thirds but is still a very nice picture. 9', '2003-11-18 02:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(488661, 46521, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. I just love the reflections. 10</td>', 'Wonderful picture. I just love the reflections. 10', '2003-11-18 02:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(488662, 46354, 12902, '<td valign="top">My god, where are you from to have such a beauty at this time of the year... Looks so fraile ... I like the use of the diagonal in the picture. 10</td>', 'My god, where are you from to have such a beauty at this time of the year... Looks so fraile ... I like the use of the diagonal in the picture. 10', '2003-11-18 02:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(488664, 46674, 12902, '<td valign="top">Another diagonal well used. Good DOF, nice contrasting colours, almost good lighting. The red leave or branch has a few hot spots. Still a very good photo. 9</td>', 'Another diagonal well used. Good DOF, nice contrasting colours, almost good lighting. The red leave or branch has a few hot spots. Still a very good photo. 9', '2003-11-18 02:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(488667, 46463, 7252, '<td valign="top">The photo is nice but I don''t really see how it illustrates Networking for Dummies. Networking sure but where is the dummies part?</td>', 'The photo is nice but I don''t really see how it illustrates Networking for Dummies. Networking sure but where is the dummies part?', '2003-11-18 02:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(488670, 46649, 7252, '<td valign="top">Needs a little work but the concept is hilarious!</td>', 'Needs a little work but the concept is hilarious!', '2003-11-18 03:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(488677, 46396, 7260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-11-18 04:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(488678, 46369, 7260, '<td valign="top">Very cooperative cat.</td>', 'Very cooperative cat.', '2003-11-18 04:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(488679, 46622, 7260, '<td valign="top">Kind of disturbing, perhaps a little lighter.</td>', 'Kind of disturbing, perhaps a little lighter.', '2003-11-18 04:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(488680, 45995, 7260, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I wouldn''t change anything here. Good job.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I wouldn''t change anything here. Good job.', '2003-11-18 04:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(488681, 46515, 7260, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but the buildings across the street look more interesting to me, they look like they were photographed in the 50''s.</td>', 'Nice picture but the buildings across the street look more interesting to me, they look like they were photographed in the 50''s.', '2003-11-18 04:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(488683, 46401, 7260, '<td valign="top">Ther''s a bit of backround clutter here but otherwise this is a great picture</td>', 'Ther''s a bit of backround clutter here but otherwise this is a great picture', '2003-11-18 04:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(488685, 46429, 7260, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, the hand needs to be alittle more in focus.</td>', 'this is a great shot, the hand needs to be alittle more in focus.', '2003-11-18 04:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(488686, 46600, 7260, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of motion here.</td>', 'I like the feeling of motion here.', '2003-11-18 04:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(488688, 46112, 6999, '<td valign="top">Arguably not a book, but I''m not splitting hairs. I think the perspective distortion really hurts this image. Also perhaps you haven''t got far enough away, or you''ve cropped too close - including what I presume are more pillars either sie of these archways would emphasise the repetition more fully. As it is ... well, solid photography, but there''s no drama, no mystery - if you could have shot it at night, with light streaming out of just one window ...</td>', 'Arguably not a book, but I''m not splitting hairs. I think the perspective distortion really hurts this image. Also perhaps you haven''t got far enough away, or you''ve cropped too close - including what I presume are more pillars either sie of these archways would emphasise the repetition more fully. As it is ... well, solid photography, but there''s no drama, no mystery - if you could have shot it at night, with light streaming out of just one window ...', '2003-11-18 04:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(488689, 46680, 7260, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting.</td>', 'Neat lighting.', '2003-11-18 04:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(488693, 46488, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think this is working in two contradictory ways: the hue shift is intriguing, making it look almost like a pop art piece - but then the dirtiness of the seat works against the stylised look of that genre. I think you fall between two stools here ...</td>', 'I think this is working in two contradictory ways: the hue shift is intriguing, making it look almost like a pop art piece - but then the dirtiness of the seat works against the stylised look of that genre. I think you fall between two stools here ...', '2003-11-18 05:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(488697, 46652, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition - slight blowing out of highlights (well, more than slight really) on the white paint is a touch annoying, but only a touch.</td>', 'Beautiful composition - slight blowing out of highlights (well, more than slight really) on the white paint is a touch annoying, but only a touch.', '2003-11-18 05:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(488698, 46448, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous. Has the desolation, the relentlessness, and even the period feel of the book. Sepia is excellently done, and I like the almost graphic composition too - verges on the edge of being just shapes.</td>', 'Marvellous. Has the desolation, the relentlessness, and even the period feel of the book. Sepia is excellently done, and I like the almost graphic composition too - verges on the edge of being just shapes.', '2003-11-18 05:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(488700, 46649, 10268, '<td valign="top">Haha.<br/> <br/>That''s awesome.</td>', 'Haha. That''s awesome.', '2003-11-18 05:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(488728, 46670, 5822, '<td valign="top">Despite the centered subject matter, I like the composition and especially the colored background. I think what''s missing is lack of visual detail of the interesting looking sword, which I think should be lit better. Also, more accoutrements of that period of history would also add more interest, such as, a draped robe or shield.</td>', 'Despite the centered subject matter, I like the composition and especially the colored background. I think what''s missing is lack of visual detail of the interesting looking sword, which I think should be lit better. Also, more accoutrements of that period of history would also add more interest, such as, a draped robe or shield.', '2003-11-18 08:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(488756, 45926, 12194, '<td valign="top">wow, a cool capture of the sky, a very good contrast between the art opf nature - yellow trees and the art of man - that sculpture. It gives an impression of some kind of a sci-fi scene.... 10</td>', 'wow, a cool capture of the sky, a very good contrast between the art opf nature - yellow trees and the art of man - that sculpture. It gives an impression of some kind of a sci-fi scene.... 10', '2003-11-18 09:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(488758, 46664, 13612, '<td valign="top">most imaginative photo on this contest, congratulations! hope it wins.</td>', 'most imaginative photo on this contest, congratulations! hope it wins.', '2003-11-18 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(488762, 46131, 12441, '<td valign="top">I wish I could reach in and re-organize the layout of this picture. I like the execution, just not the layout. I''d like to see one shoe about to crush the figure and the other lifting off a crushed figure. But, then that would really throw off the innocence of this picture.</td>', 'I wish I could reach in and re-organize the layout of this picture. I like the execution, just not the layout. I''d like to see one shoe about to crush the figure and the other lifting off a crushed figure. But, then that would really throw off the innocence of this picture.', '2003-11-18 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(488774, 46204, 5822, '<td valign="top">Hard to see the castle, but I like this image anyway.  I especially like what you''ve done with the colors, as it makes it appear surrealistic.</td>', 'Hard to see the castle, but I like this image anyway.  I especially like what you''ve done with the colors, as it makes it appear surrealistic.', '2003-11-18 10:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(488778, 45869, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting effect of light - is this taken through a window? The graininess, and the bleeding away of light in the corners helps the mystery of it, though the white pentagon is weird. Intersting stuff, thankyou for submitting it.</td>', 'Intersting effect of light - is this taken through a window? The graininess, and the bleeding away of light in the corners helps the mystery of it, though the white pentagon is weird. Intersting stuff, thankyou for submitting it.', '2003-11-18 10:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(488787, 46302, 14256, '<td valign="top">great work</td>', 'great work', '2003-11-18 10:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(488788, 45802, 12408, '<td valign="top">is this a book? I always thought it was a stage show! But it''s a bloody good picture!</td>', 'is this a book? I always thought it was a stage show! But it''s a bloody good picture!', '2003-11-18 10:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(488798, 46629, 12408, '<td valign="top">This looks manipulated to me - allowed in this contest? otherwise rather good</td>', 'This looks manipulated to me - allowed in this contest? otherwise rather good', '2003-11-18 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(488812, 46611, 13113, '<td valign="top">Like the idea. Advice: Could shine a little bit but other wise it''s a cool idea.</td>', 'Like the idea. Advice: Could shine a little bit but other wise it''s a cool idea.', '2003-11-18 12:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(488815, 46548, 13113, '<td valign="top">Like the idea although it''s kinda blurry but other wise excellant idea. 9!!</td>', 'Like the idea although it''s kinda blurry but other wise excellant idea. 9!!', '2003-11-18 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(488816, 46093, 13113, '<td valign="top">Geat idea but could sharpen up a little bit but that''s me. 9.</td>', 'Geat idea but could sharpen up a little bit but that''s me. 9.', '2003-11-18 12:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
