(488926, 46396, 6999, '<td valign="top">Clever approach to the title, technically excellent shot too. I like this because it relies on the reflection of light, rather than the refraction that so many stopped motion water shots do. There''s still somethnig not quite gripping about it for me - it may only be that I''ve played with such effects so much myself :-)</td>', 'Clever approach to the title, technically excellent shot too. I like this because it relies on the reflection of light, rather than the refraction that so many stopped motion water shots do. There''s still somethnig not quite gripping about it for me - it may only be that I''ve played with such effects so much myself :-)', '2003-11-18 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
