(489097, 46089, 8860, '<td valign="top">I was going to do this title too but couldn''t get far enough away from humans! Glad I didn''t anyway because you''ve done a beautiful job. Lovely scene and composition. You deserve to do well with this.</td>', 'I was going to do this title too but couldn''t get far enough away from humans! Glad I didn''t anyway because you''ve done a beautiful job. Lovely scene and composition. You deserve to do well with this.', '2003-11-18 18:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
