(489105, 46097, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your JPEG compression appears extremely heavy, which is a shame because this looks like a beautiful scene - very clean and well composed. You''ll probably suffer in the scores but it''s worth posting a clear, less compressed version when the challenge ends.</td>', 'Your JPEG compression appears extremely heavy, which is a shame because this looks like a beautiful scene - very clean and well composed. You''ll probably suffer in the scores but it''s worth posting a clear, less compressed version when the challenge ends.', '2003-11-18 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
