(489393, 46122, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this was a very good attempt to illustrate the book.  But you set your JPEG compression ratio too high, and that has degraded the photo.  Also, while the effect is nice, the close up, just off center composition isn''t as interesting as I think other versions might be.  (Actually, it works well as a thumbnail).</td>', 'I think this was a very good attempt to illustrate the book.  But you set your JPEG compression ratio too high, and that has degraded the photo.  Also, while the effect is nice, the close up, just off center composition isn''t as interesting as I think other versions might be.  (Actually, it works well as a thumbnail).', '2003-11-19 02:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
