(489726, 46396, 8159, '<td valign="top">To: kiwiness<br/>From: EddyG<br/>Subject: Scoring of future entries<br/> <br/>Dear kiwiness:<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your recent winning entry. As you may or may not be aware, now that you have earned ten (10) ribbons here at DPChallenge, you are now subject to the "Give Others A Chance" Scoring Adjuster. This means that after all of the the votes are calculated into a final score, the score of any of your future entries will be multipled by 80% (0.80) in an effort to allow others to have a shot at winning a blue ribbon. Congratulations again, and thank you for your participation here at DPC.<br/> <br/><b>Just kidding Gary!! Way to go on yet another Blue for your growing collection! <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/worship.gif'', strrpos(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/worship.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/worship.gif"/></b></td>', 'To: kiwinessFrom: EddyGSubject: Scoring of future entries Dear kiwiness: Congratulations on your recent winning entry. As you may or may not be aware, now that you have earned ten (10) ribbons here at DPChallenge, you are now subject to the "Give Others A Chance" Scoring Adjuster. This means that after all of the the votes are calculated into a final score, the score of any of your future entries will be multipled by 80% (0.80) in an effort to allow others to have a shot at winning a blue ribbon. Congratulations again, and thank you for your participation here at DPC. Just kidding Gary!! Way to go on yet another Blue for your growing collection! ', '2003-11-19 08:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
