(489744, 46507, 6458, '<td valign="top">Hi Dave,<br/>  I thought I might have been a bit harsh in my comment on your photo earlier. This isn''t really a bad photograph, but it just doesn''t capture the imagination. I took the liberty of playing with this photo a bit on my own.. boosting the contrast definitely helps spruce up the image, but I couldn''t find a crop that really brought out your title. <br/> <br/>Perhaps shooting at a different time of day or with some dramatic clouds in the background would have helped? <br/> <br/>-Matt</td>', 'Hi Dave,  I thought I might have been a bit harsh in my comment on your photo earlier. This isn''t really a bad photograph, but it just doesn''t capture the imagination. I took the liberty of playing with this photo a bit on my own.. boosting the contrast definitely helps spruce up the image, but I couldn''t find a crop that really brought out your title.  Perhaps shooting at a different time of day or with some dramatic clouds in the background would have helped?  -Matt', '2003-11-19 09:00:02.000000', NULL, 0),
