(489760, 46296, 11096, '<td valign="top">I took some left over building material, pillars for a front porch, and laid them on the side.  Then I place a cloth behind the opening, but left room to shine a light thru it.  The inside of the pillars was all rough and pitty.  I was amazed at what the photo looked like after I took it.  This was a case of taking a picture and finding a title to fit it.  I wonder how many did it that way instead of finding a title and setting up the picture to match.<br/>Thanks for all your comments.  I did think I should have more on the right and bottom but there was another pillar there that had to be cut out to make it look like a fake eclipse.</td>', 'I took some left over building material, pillars for a front porch, and laid them on the side.  Then I place a cloth behind the opening, but left room to shine a light thru it.  The inside of the pillars was all rough and pitty.  I was amazed at what the photo looked like after I took it.  This was a case of taking a picture and finding a title to fit it.  I wonder how many did it that way instead of finding a title and setting up the picture to match.Thanks for all your comments.  I did think I should have more on the right and bottom but there was another pillar there that had to be cut out to make it look like a fake eclipse.', '2003-11-19 09:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(489762, 46521, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!!  This is a beautiful picture.</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon!!  This is a beautiful picture.', '2003-11-19 09:11:50.000000', NULL, 0),
