(489780, 46681, 12421, '<td valign="top">I found this guy about 1 hour before the end of the challenge.  I wasn''t even going to enter this challenge, but this opportunity presented itself.  Wish I would''ve had more time.  As it was, I got it uploaded only 1 minute before the deadline. <br/> <br/>It looked decent on my home computer, but when I got to work, it was so dark!  So for everyone who said, "too dark", it''s the curse of monitor settings. You are right - but it''s not what I saw in the original submission. :)</td>', 'I found this guy about 1 hour before the end of the challenge.  I wasn''t even going to enter this challenge, but this opportunity presented itself.  Wish I would''ve had more time.  As it was, I got it uploaded only 1 minute before the deadline.  It looked decent on my home computer, but when I got to work, it was so dark!  So for everyone who said, "too dark", it''s the curse of monitor settings. You are right - but it''s not what I saw in the original submission. :)', '2003-11-19 09:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(489789, 46419, 5112, '<td valign="top">Catherine, so this was your picture!  IMHO it should have scored a lot higher.  It''s just beautiful.  Pictures like yours tend to score a bit lower at this site, I''m guessing it''s because people don''t take (or don''t have) the time to look slowly, but maybe it''s something else.  Who knows.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Catherine, so this was your picture!  IMHO it should have scored a lot higher.  It''s just beautiful.  Pictures like yours tend to score a bit lower at this site, I''m guessing it''s because people don''t take (or don''t have) the time to look slowly, but maybe it''s something else.  Who knows. ', '2003-11-19 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
