(490918, 46226, 6870, '<td valign="top">Whatever you do, DO NOT get rid of that cork silk in the middle of the shot. I just love this image, and wish it had done better in the challenge. Wonderful depth of field, and the colors and focus are sharp when they need to be. Marvelous work! Give us more!</td>', 'Whatever you do, DO NOT get rid of that cork silk in the middle of the shot. I just love this image, and wish it had done better in the challenge. Wonderful depth of field, and the colors and focus are sharp when they need to be. Marvelous work! Give us more!', '2003-11-20 10:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
