(491676, 46606, 13722, '<td valign="top">I was really happy with this picture. I actually had entered another picture and then came back from the trip the Lumpkin and entered this one after seeing it on the computer. I''m wishing I''d cropped out the little bit of street sign on the right, but I didn''t notice that before. Thanks to everyone for all the nice comments. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I was really happy with this picture. I actually had entered another picture and then came back from the trip the Lumpkin and entered this one after seeing it on the computer. I''m wishing I''d cropped out the little bit of street sign on the right, but I didn''t notice that before. Thanks to everyone for all the nice comments.  ', '2003-11-21 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(491846, 46521, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, expansive composition. Love the airy light and cleanliness of this - very good concept too. <br/> <br/>Just by way of info, it looks a touch ''overlightened'' on my Powerbook LCD (loss of tone in clouds and top of mountains).</td>', 'Beautiful, expansive composition. Love the airy light and cleanliness of this - very good concept too.  Just by way of info, it looks a touch ''overlightened'' on my Powerbook LCD (loss of tone in clouds and top of mountains).', '2003-11-21 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
