(521263, 45905, 8816, '<td valign="top">This shot IMO, deserved a much higher score then it got!  People always mark down a little too heavily for not completely fitting the challenge, or if it requires them to strectch their artistic minds a little.  This is a fantastic candid, and a great black and white.  The shadows may be a little distracting, but that''s life!  Nice shot!</td>', 'This shot IMO, deserved a much higher score then it got!  People always mark down a little too heavily for not completely fitting the challenge, or if it requires them to strectch their artistic minds a little.  This is a fantastic candid, and a great black and white.  The shadows may be a little distracting, but that''s life!  Nice shot!', '2003-12-23 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
