(536429, 45693, 15703, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  We all have to do a light-trails shot sooner or later. I am sure mine won''t be as fabulous as this one. A super vantage point over a great location which gave you both moving and stationary traffic. Yum-yum!</td>', 'Lovely shot!  We all have to do a light-trails shot sooner or later. I am sure mine won''t be as fabulous as this one. A super vantage point over a great location which gave you both moving and stationary traffic. Yum-yum!', '2004-01-08 13:28:54.000000', NULL, 0),
