(538268, 46122, 15703, '<td valign="top">Reminds me very much of a video still. What an excellent and scary submission!  Even the dab of compression simply adds to its quality as a spooky video capture.  The girl''s expression is menacingly unconcerned.</td>', 'Reminds me very much of a video still. What an excellent and scary submission!  Even the dab of compression simply adds to its quality as a spooky video capture.  The girl''s expression is menacingly unconcerned.', '2004-01-10 18:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
