(547226, 46418, 16188, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the irony part - never read the book some of you are talking about - it just hurts to look at it.  I guess I''m not jaded enough to find it funny.  I enjoy reading the various takes on it, though, as well as your reaction.  It reminds me that times have changed and that''s something that gets harder to keep in mind as the decades pass.</td>', 'I don''t get the irony part - never read the book some of you are talking about - it just hurts to look at it.  I guess I''m not jaded enough to find it funny.  I enjoy reading the various takes on it, though, as well as your reaction.  It reminds me that times have changed and that''s something that gets harder to keep in mind as the decades pass.', '2004-01-18 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(554158, 46418, 13781, '<td valign="top">oh lord. give it up, i''m not serious about this picture. i obviously didn''t take time to "compose" it...and yeah, i''m into photography. but i guess i''m not at all a fan of the whole ''studio'' look. i guess i don''t see what the point of photography is if you''re going to try soooo hard to make something look perfect. You''re not fooling anyone, nothing is perfect. look at bush. now, look at all of his followers.....<br/> <br/> <br/>haha, that too...was obviously to get a reaction.<br/>:) i read these comments when i''m in a bad mood, and walk away with a smile on my face:)</td>', 'oh lord. give it up, i''m not serious about this picture. i obviously didn''t take time to "compose" it...and yeah, i''m into photography. but i guess i''m not at all a fan of the whole ''studio'' look. i guess i don''t see what the point of photography is if you''re going to try soooo hard to make something look perfect. You''re not fooling anyone, nothing is perfect. look at bush. now, look at all of his followers.....  haha, that too...was obviously to get a reaction.:) i read these comments when i''m in a bad mood, and walk away with a smile on my face:)', '2004-01-23 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
