(1713108, 46647, 34659, '<td valign="top">I not only thoroughly enjoyed the book, but I thoroughly enjoy this tribute as well.  Great composition and tones.  Your choices of the muted purple tones fit in perfectly with the time period (at least of what would be left) of da Vinci.  Outstanding piece of work!  :-)</td>', 'I not only thoroughly enjoyed the book, but I thoroughly enjoy this tribute as well.  Great composition and tones.  Your choices of the muted purple tones fit in perfectly with the time period (at least of what would be left) of da Vinci.  Outstanding piece of work!  :-)', '2005-09-16 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
