(2410085, 46615, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s fun to visit older images and comment. I can''t believe I''ve not already done so.<br/> <br/>Just stunning. I love the way you almost cut the leaf in half, yet still have that center vein in full view. The tones and vivid quality of it is just stellar.  GREAT macro.</td>', 'It''s fun to visit older images and comment. I can''t believe I''ve not already done so. Just stunning. I love the way you almost cut the leaf in half, yet still have that center vein in full view. The tones and vivid quality of it is just stellar.  GREAT macro.', '2006-05-12 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
