(2632462, 46418, 60799, '<td valign="top">comments sure can be funny sometimes,  LOL!<br/> <br/>I think one of the funniest parts of the whole thing is that you''ve placed it in the "nude" gallery... LMAO.<br/> <br/>Another funny thing... you can tell from the thumbnail that it''s going to be sick, yet you have "Views since voting: 2866", who is really sick here?  This all just proves that art doesn''t have to be beautiful to be successful... you got a reaction out of people and that''s what it should be all about!<br/></td>', 'comments sure can be funny sometimes,  LOL! I think one of the funniest parts of the whole thing is that you''ve placed it in the "nude" gallery... LMAO. Another funny thing... you can tell from the thumbnail that it''s going to be sick, yet you have "Views since voting: 2866", who is really sick here?  This all just proves that art doesn''t have to be beautiful to be successful... you got a reaction out of people and that''s what it should be all about!', '2006-07-18 07:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
